"elephant_yam_raita_recipe_in_hindi": { title: "Elephant Yam Raita (Recipe In Hindi)", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🥗 Salad", all_ingredients: ["1/2 green chilli","1-1 / 2 teaspoon Rye","asafetida - a pinch","250 grams Elephant yam","salt - as per taste","3 tablespoons coriander - chopped","1 inch ginger","1 cup curd","1 teaspoon oil","1-1 / 2 teaspoon Kali Urad Dal (Split)"], product_ids: [930,2308,973,4142,503,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To make Senai Pachadi, first peel and cut the yam into small pieces","Now in a pressure cooker add water, yam as per use and cook till 3 cities come","With the pressure coming out automatically, take out the yam separately","Also keep the remaining water separately","Now add green coriander, green chillies, ginger and yam in a mixer grinder","Now heat oil in a tempering pan","Add the ingredients given for tempering and cook it for 30 seconds","In a bowl, add yam mixture, curd and remaining water and mix ✅"] },
"drunken_noodles_recipe_drunken_noodles_recipe": { title: "Drunken Noodles Recipe - Drunken Noodles Recipe", serves: "3", time: "35 min", category: "🍝 Pasta", all_ingredients: ["1 tbsp fish sauce","1/4 cup capsicum (red) - cut","1/2 cup baby corn - cut","6 cloves garlic - finely chopped","1/2 tbsp brown sugar","1/2 Tbsp honey","1/4 cup capsicum (green) - cut","1/3 cup green onions","1/4 cup Thai Basil leaves - cut","1 inch ginger - finely chopped","1 tbsp soy sauce","200 grams rice noodles"], product_ids: [2307,2311,2314,1840,1842,476,925,927], steps: ["To make the drunken noodles recipe, firstly boil the flat noodles","Boil 2 cups of water in a saucepan","Add a pinch of salt and some oil to it and let it boil on high heat","When the water boils, add the noodles and cook till it becomes soft","Take care not to boil too much","Turn off the gas and drain the water","Keep the noodles under cold water, so that the noodles stop cooking","Transfer the noodles to a bowl ✅"] },
