"lemon_and_ginger_spicy_black_eyed_beans_recipe": { title: "Lemon And Ginger Spicy Black Eyed Beans Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["2 inch Ginger - julienned (fine)","1 tablespoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","1 Red Yellow or Green Bell Pepper (Capsicum) - finely chopped","Salt - to taste","4 sprig Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - chopped","1 cup Black Eyed Beans (Lobia) - soaked in water overnight","1 Onion - chopped","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder - or red chilli flakes","1 teaspoon Lemon juice - adjustable","3 cloves Garlic - minced","2 Tomatoes - blanched","2 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,973,48,1840,2300,476], steps: ["To begin making the Lemon and Ginger Spicy Black Eyed Beans recipe, firstly pressure cook the Black eyed beans with 2-3 ","Drain and reserve the water.In a pan heat the oil","Add the onion, garlic and sauté for a minute till the onions are soft.After the onions are soft, add the pepper and saut","Add the ginger reserving a few juliennes for garnish.Add the cumin powder and chili powder or flakes","Add the tomatoes and a ladleful of the water leftover from cooking the beans.Cook for 3-4 minutes and add the beans","Sprinkle salt and mix well.Stir and cook for 2 minutes.Take Spicy Black Eyed Beans off the heat, and transfer into a ser","Garnish with the coriander leaves and lime juice.Serve the Lemon and Ginger Spicy Black Eyed Beans along with Spinach An"] },
