"orange_peppermint_green_tea_punch_recipe": { title: "Orange Peppermint Green Tea Punch Recipe", serves: "3", time: "25 min", category: "🥤 Smoothie", all_ingredients: ["2 teaspoons Ginger - grated","2 cups Fresh orange juice","2 tablespoons Tea Monk Seiki Peppermint Green Tea","4 cups Chilled water"], product_ids: [16,946,2307,2300], steps: ["To begin making the Orange Green Tea Punch Recipe, in a large saucepan, bring water to a boil and turn off the heat.Add ","Let the tea brew for 5 minutes.Strain the tea into a pitcher and discard the tea leaves","Allow the tea to cool and refrigerate for 2 hours.After 2 hours stir in the orange juice","Pour the Orange Green Tea Punch into serving glass, add ice cubes and serve chilled.Serve the Orange Green Tea Punch Rec"] },
