"veg_mughlai_paratha_recipe": { title: "Veg Mughlai Paratha Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["1 Red Bell pepper (Capsicum) - finely chopped","1 Carrot (Gajjar) - grated","5 cloves Garlic - finely chopped","1/4 cup Mint Leaves (Pudina) - finely chopped","Salt - to taste","2 cups Paneer (Homemade Cottage Cheese) - grated","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","1/2 teaspoon Garam masala powder","2 Green Chillies - finely chopped","1 Onion - finely chopped","1/4 cup Whole Wheat Flour","2 cups Whole Wheat Flour"], product_ids: [2307,973,1840,4145,946,468,2300,4152], steps: ["To begin making the Veg Mughlai Paratha Recipe, get all the ingredients ready and prepped up.For dough, in a large mixin","Add a little water at a time to make a smooth dough","Once the dough has come together, drizzle a little oil and knead again to make the dough smooth.To make the mughlai stuf","Add the onion, ginger, garlic, and bell peppers.Saute until the onion and bell pepper have softened.Add the grated carro","Stir well to combine and turn off the heat.Check the salt and seasonings and adjust according to taste","In a small mixing bowl, combine the wheat flour and water and make a smooth paste without lumps","This is called the slurry mixture","Divide the dough into 4 large portions ✅"] },
