"kerala_chicken_curry_recipe_with_freshly_ground_sp": { title: "Kerala Chicken Curry Recipe With Freshly Ground Spices", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["1 inch Cinnamon Stick (Dalchini)","8 Curry leaves","1 inch Ginger - grated","Coconut Oil","1 teaspoon Mustard seeds","6 cloves Garlic - finely chopped","1 tablespoon Whole Black Peppercorns","1 teaspoon Fennel seeds (Saunf)","2 Dry Red Chillies","Salt - as per taste","500 Chicken - medium sized pieces","1/2 cup Coconut milk - or grated fresh coconut"], product_ids: [930,2307,2308,9,2314,973,4141,1842], steps: ["Then turn off the flame, allow it to cool and grind to a corase powder using a mixer-grinder","Heat oil in kadai, add mustard seeds","When it splutters, add onion and curry leaves","Sauté.When onions are lightly brown, add ginger, garlic, and sauté for a minute.Add chicken, half of the ground masala, ","If using grated or desiccated coconut, add in.Mix them, cover with a lid, simmer and cook till the chicken is almost don","Serve the Kerala Chicken Curry With Freshly Ground Spices along with Kerala Style Appam Recipe (Without Yeast) or Ghee R"] },
"fulkopir_paturi_recipe": { title: "Fulkopir Paturi Recipe", serves: "3", time: "85 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["3/4 teaspoon poppy seeds - powder","1/4 cup coconut - grated","1 teaspoon Rye - powder","4 garlic - bud","1/4 teaspoon turmeric powder","Sunflower Oil - few drops for greasing","oil - to grease","1/2 banana leaves - steamer To put in","1 cup cabbage - grated","salt - according to taste","1/2 teaspoon cumin seeds","1/4 teaspoon red chilli powder"], product_ids: [2307,9,2314,973,27,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To make Phoolkopir Paturi, first wash the cabbage thoroughly and soak in hot water for 2 to 3 minutes","Keep it aside","Now in a mixer grinder, add mustard seeds, poppy seeds, green chillies, coconut, garlic, some water and make a paste","Now in a bowl add cauliflower, ground paste, salt, sugar, turmeric powder, red chili powder, mustard oil, cumin seeds an","Keep it aside for 1 hour","Put a banana leaf in the steamer","Now take small pieces of cabbage mixture and make it with your hands like gatta","Put these gattos in the middle of a banana leaf ✅"] },
