"paneer_satay_recipe": { title: "Paneer Satay Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","3 cloves Garlic - grated","Salt - to taste","1 inch Ginger - grated","2 tablespoons Dark soy sauce","500 grams Paneer (Homemade Cottage Cheese) - cut lengthwise of 1 inch thickness","1 tablespoon Sesame (Gingelly) Oil"], product_ids: [2307,2311,4145,4152,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Paneer Satay Recipe, combine the marinade ingredients including ginger, garlic, turmeric powder, dar","Keep drizzling some of the marinade as the paneer is roasting, so it absorbs additional flavors.The paneer satay is done","Transfer the paneer satay onto a serving plate and serve hot.Serve this delicious Paneer Satay Recipe along with Peanut "] },
