"quick_and_easy_bread_upma_recipe": { title: "Quick and Easy Bread Upma Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["Butter - for cooking","2 sprig Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Mustard seeds","16 Whole Wheat Brown Bread","2 Green Chillies - finely chopped","3 Tomatoes - chopped small","1 teaspoon Sambar Powder","3 sprig Curry leaves","1 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","2 Onions - thinly sliced"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,973,4143,4144,2300,920], steps: ["To begin making the bread upma recipe, we will first toast the bread","You can toast it in your toaster or on a skillet.Once the bread is toasted, apply the softened butter over the toasted b","Next cut the bread into small dices and keep aside.In a large wok or a kadai, heat 1 tablespoon of oil on medium heat an","Allow the mustard seeds to crackle and add in the onions and green chillies","Saute the onions on medium heat, until soft and tender.Once the onions are soft, add in the tomatoes, curry leaves, turm","Stir and cook the tomatoes until they turn lightly soft as well.Finally add in the salt and the toasted buttered bread p","Stir well to combine all the ingredients and stir fry on medium to high heat for a couple of minutes.We stir fry just to","Check salt levels ✅"] },
"thandai_kulfi_recipe_holi_recipe": { title: "Thandai Kulfi Recipe - Holi Recipe", serves: "3", time: "80 min", category: "🥤 Smoothie", all_ingredients: ["2 tablespoons Poppy seeds","2 teaspoons Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","8 Whole Black Peppercorns","1/4 cup Badam (Almond) - blanched and peeled","1/4 cup Cashew nuts","1/4 cup Pistachios","3 liter Milk - (I use 2% fat)","1/2 teaspoon Cinnamon Powder (Dalchini)","1/2 cup Sugar","1 tablespoon Fennel seeds (Saunf)"], product_ids: [2307,2308,2314,4141,1842,2300], steps: ["To begin making the Thandai Kulfi Recipe, first we will make a paste of the Thadai Masala by blending all the ingredient","Keep this thandai masala aside.To begin making the Kulfi Recipe, the first step is to have to condense the milk","For this heat milk in a heavy bottomed saucepan and bring it to boil.Once the milk comes to a boil, turn the heat to low","It is important to note that during the initial stages of milk condensation frequent stirring is important, but as it be","This is because condensed milk tends to get stuck to the bottom and sides of the pan and burn; leading to a very unpleas","Burning of milk is also toxic so you want to be extra careful.Once it the milk is reduced to more than half of its quant","Finally stir in the Thandai Paste Mix and give the mixture a good stir","You can even use a hand blender to give it a good whisk.Turn off the heat and allow the kulfi mixture to cool completely"] },
