"guacamole_stuffed_quesadilla_with_mint_mayo_recipe": { title: "Guacamole Stuffed Quesadilla With Mint Mayo Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1 Red Bell pepper (Capsicum) - finely chopped","Butter (unsalted) - for cooking","Salt - to taste","2 Green Chillies - finely chopped","1 Onion - finely chopped","1/4 cup All Purpose Flour (Maida)","2-3 cloves Garlic - chopped","4 tablespoons Del Monte Mint Mayo","1 Avocado","1 cup Whole Wheat Flour","1 Tomato - pulp removed","1 Yellow Bell Pepper (Capsicum) - finely chopped"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,973,48,1840,946,4144], steps: ["To begin making Guacamole Stuffed Quesadilla With Mint Mayo Recipe, mix the dry ingredients - wheat flour, maida flour a","Add enough water to bind the mixture so that it is also easy to roll","Check for seasoning and salt.Divide the dough into small equal balls and roll it on the board to a 6 inch diameter","Serve your yummy filled Guacamole Stuffed Quesadilla as an appetizer or for an afternoon quick meal along with Corn Pine"] },
"bharwa_lauki_recipe_in_no_onion_no_garlic_makhani": { title: "Bharwa Lauki Recipe In No Onion No Garlic Makhani Gravy", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["1 Green Chilli - finely chopped","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1 Bottle gourd (lauki) - peeled and cut into roundels","1 tablespoon Gram flour (besan)","1 teaspoon Garam masala powder","Salt - to taste","1 cup Homemade tomato puree","2 Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","2 tablespoons Fresh cream","Emami Rice Bran Oil - as needed","1 tablespoon Kasuri Methi (Dried Fenugreek Leaves)"], product_ids: [545,930,929,2307,2308,973,462,4141], steps: ["To begin making the Bharwa Lauki Recipe In No Onion No Garlic Makhani Gravy, first prep and keep all the ingredients rea","Fill the cut lauki roundels with the stuffing.Heat a shallow pan with a little oil on medium heat","Stir for another couple of minutes until the tomatoes begin to come to a bubble state.Stir in the fresh cream and give i","If you don't have access to coal, you can skip this step.Place the coal on the flame and allow it to become red hot","Once you notice that the coal is red hot, place it in a small heat proof cup","Place this cup of coal on top of the simmering Bharwa Lauki.Add a spoon of ghee on top of the coal","It will begin to smoke","At this stage, immediately close the lid  and allow the mixture to simmer for another 5 minutes ✅"] },
"assamese_narasingh_masor_jhol_recipe_fish_in_curry": { title: "Assamese Narasingh Masor Jhol Recipe (Fish In Curry Leaves Gravy)", serves: "3", time: "20 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Whole Black Peppercorns - ground roughly","4 Sardine fish - or carps","4 Garlic","Lukewarm Water - as needed","3 Dry Red Chilli - (adjust)","Curry leaves - 1 bunch","2 Green Chillies - (adjust)","1 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1 tablespoon Mustard oil"], product_ids: [2307,973,4143,1842,920,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making Assamese Narasingh Masor Jhol Recipe (Fish In Curry Leaves Gravy), clean the fishes, their stomach and r","Halve them if you have selected a little bigger fish like sardine.Marinate the sardines in turmeric and salt","(or any fish you have selected)Smear the mustard oil on a shallow fry pan and heat, on a medium heat till it is close to","(Do not allow the oil to come to smoking point if you are using cooking oil other than mustard oil)Make sure the pan is ","See at all times that the gravy does not get burnt.Add a pinch of turmeric powder and salt to taste ✅"] },
"shrimp_walnut_bruschetta_recipe_flavored_with_chee": { title: "Shrimp Walnut Bruschetta Recipe Flavored With Cheesy Dip", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["Butter - as required","1 Baguette - cut into slices","Red Chilli flakes - as needed","1/4 cup Green olives - chopped","250 grams Shrimps - cleaned and deveined","4 tablespoons Del Monte Cheesy Dip","Salt - as needed","3 sprig Dill leaves - chopped","Salad leaves - (rocket leaves or any other salad leaf)","Black pepper powder - as needed","Extra Virgin Olive Oil - as required","3 cloves Garlic - finely chopped"], product_ids: [2307,973,4144,922,2301,2302,2303], steps: ["To begin making the Shrimp Walnut Bruschetta Recipe Flavored With Cheesy Dip Mayo, get all the ingredients prepped and r","Apply little oil on each side of the baguette slices, season with salt and pepper","Heat the pan and toast the slices until brown and crisp","You can also toast it in preheated oven at 180 C for 10 minutes until crisp and roasted.Take the baguette slices out of ","In the same pan, melt 1 tablespoon of butter","Add garlic and saute until golden and aromaticAdd shrimps and toss on high for a minute","Cook for 5 to 6 minutes until the shrimp is nicely seared and done","Season with salt pepper and chili flakes ✅"] },
