"fennel_potato_croquettes_with_paneer_recipe": { title: "Fennel Potato Croquettes With Paneer Recipe", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["100 grams Paneer (Homemade Cottage Cheese) - crumbled","Whole Wheat Bread crumbs","1 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","2 tablespoons All Purpose Flour (Maida)","Salt - to taste","Sunflower Oil - for coating","2 teaspoons Fennel seeds (Saunf) - coarsely pounded","2 Green Chillies - finely chopped","1 Onion - finely chopped","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - small bunch","1 Egg white - (optional)","4 Potatoes (Aloo) - boiled"], product_ids: [930,2307,973,4143,4145,4148,2300,4152], steps: ["To begin making the Fennel Potato Croquettes with Paneer recipe, we will first get all the ingredients ready","In a bowl, make a dough of the paneer by combining it with a pinch of salt","Divide the paneer into 6 portions and shape them into ovals.In another bowl, combine the remaining ingredients except th","Combine well, so the potatoes are mashed and well combined","Divide the potato mixture into 6 portions.Oil the palm of your hands, take a portion of the potato and flatten it on the","Place a portion of the paneer in the center and cover back with the potato as its cover","Proceed the similar way with the remaining potatoes and the paneer portions.Preheat the airfryer or your oven at 200 C a","If you eat eggs, then first dip the potato croquette into the egg whites then roll through the bread crumbs ✅"] },
"drumstick_leaves_sabzi_with_crushed_peanuts_recipe": { title: "Drumstick Leaves Sabzi With Crushed Peanuts Recipe", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["Salt - to taste","1/4 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1 Onion - chopped","1/4 teaspoon Mustard seeds","2 cloves Garlic - finely chopped","1/4 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","2 cups Drumstick Leaves (Moringa/Murungai Keerai)","1/4 cup Water","1 teaspoon Sunflower Oil","2 teaspoons Roasted Peanuts (Moongphali)","2 tablespoon Fresh coconut - grated"], product_ids: [2307,9,973,464,2300,503,476,2301], steps: ["To begin making Drumstick Leaves Sabzi With Crushed Peanuts Recipe, first wash the drumstick leaves and drain the water ","Crush the roasted peanuts with sharp knife and set aside in a bowl","Grate some fresh coconut, chop the garlic and onion and keep all the ingredients ready","In a heavy bottomed pan, add some oil and wait for it to heat up","Once the oil is hot add mustard seeds and cumin seeds and let it crackle on medium heat","Now add in the chopped onions and garlic and saute for a few minutes until the onions become soft","Add in the drumstick leaves, chilli powder and stir the sabzi well","Add salt for taste and sprinkle some water for the Drumstick Leaves to cook ✅"] },
