"black_cherry_glazed_thandai_burfi_recipe": { title: "Black Cherry Glazed Thandai Burfi Recipe", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🥤 Smoothie", all_ingredients: ["500 gram Bottle gourd (lauki) - grated","1 tablespoon Cashew nuts - chopped","100 gram Sugar","120 gram Khoya (Mawa)","1/2 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","Green food colour - a pinch (optional)","1/2 cup Cherry Preserve /Jam - for glazing","1-1/2 tablespoon Ghee","1-1/2 tablespoons Thandai Masala","1 tablespoon Badam (Almond)"], product_ids: [3,2307,2314,4140,462,4148,2300], steps: ["To begin making Black Cherry Glazed Thandai Burfi Recipe, firstly heat a pan with clarified butter and add the grated bo","Add in the required sugar and cook it until the mixture becomes dry.Once it is done, add mawa, thandai masala, chopped c","Make sure that you mix everything well","(You can avoid the green colour)Meanwhile, grease an aluminium tray with ghee","Pour this mixture in the tray and spread it evenly.Let it cool down for 3-4 hours","After 3-4 hours, cut the pieces of your desired shape ✅"] },
"rase_wale_aloo_recipe_boiled_potato_in_tangy_tomat": { title: "Rase Wale Aloo Recipe (Boiled Potato in Tangy Tomato Sauce)", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Sugar","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","4 Tomatoes - pureed","1/4 Turmeric powder (Haldi)","6 Potatoes (Aloo) - freshly boiled (roughly chopped)","1 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera) - roasted","1 teaspoon Coriander Powder (Dhania)","Red Chilli powder - as per taste","Salt - as per taste","1/4 teaspoon Asafoetida (hing)","1/4 teaspoon Garam masala powder","Sunflower Oil - as required"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,2314,973,473,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Rase Wale Aloo recipe, in a heavy bottomed pan heat oil and temper the jeera and hing.Add tomato pur","Add all the masalas and sugar","Cook for another 30 seconds.Add the potatoes and add 1 glass water (250ml) and let it cook and reduce further to a thick","Serve Rase Wale Aloo along with Puri or Pudina Tawa Paratha for lunch or dinner ✅"] },
