"pasta_payasam_recipe_fusion_payasam_with_pasta": { title: "Pasta Payasam Recipe - Fusion Payasam With Pasta", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["4 Cashew nuts","1/2 teaspoons Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","4-5 Cashew nuts - chopped","1 teaspoon Ghee","1 Saffron strands - few","1/4 cup Fresh coconut - grated","1 tablespoon Raisins","3 cups Milk","1/2 cup Sugar","1-1/4 cup Linguine Pasta - boiled"], product_ids: [2307,8,9,2314,4140,4141,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin with Pasta Payasam Recipe, boil the pasta until al dente and keep aside","Stir in the cooked pasta, saffron and simmer for another 5 minutes until the payasam gets a good consistency","Once done, turn off the heat and transfer to a serving bowl.Heat ghee in a skillet over medium heat and add broken cashe","Add the raisins and toss for a few seconds","Once done add it to the payasam and serve.Serve Pasta Payasam as a dessert along with an indian meal like Spinach Rice R"] },
"penne_pasta_in_white_sauce_recipe": { title: "Penne Pasta In White Sauce Recipe", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🍝 Pasta", all_ingredients: ["3/4 cup Sweet corn","Italian seasoning - to taste","Salt - to taste","1 Yellow Bell Pepper (Capsicum) - diced","1 cup Broccoli - cut to florets","Red Chilli flakes - to taste","1/2 teaspoon Black pepper powder","1/2 tablespoon Butter","1-1/2 cup Milk - boiled & cooled","1-1/2 tablespoon Butter","1 Red Bell pepper (Capsicum) - diced","2 tablespoon Cheddar cheese - grated"], product_ids: [2307,4141,973,1840,4144,1842,1843,4145], steps: ["To prepare Penne Pasta In White Sauce Recipe, heat enough water in a saucepan , add salt and oil to it","Once the water boils add pasta and cook it uncovered until al dente (it is soft but firm)","Keep stirring in between.Strain the cooked pasta through a colander and reserve 1 cup of the water in which the pasta is","(this starchy water may be used further to thin the sauce)In a sauce pan melt butter on a low flame and add flour to it","Roast the flour well for about a minute.Add 1/2 of the boiled and cooled milk slowly, as you stir the flour continuously","Season it with black pepper powder, salt and chilly flakes","(be careful while adding salt as veggies and pasta also have salt).Lastly add grated cheese, mix well and cook for a whi","The white sauce is ready ✅"] },
