"tandoori_chicken_momo_recipe": { title: "Tandoori Chicken Momo Recipe", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["1/2 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","1 cup All Purpose Flour (Maida)","2 tablespoons Red Chilli sauce","1/2 teaspoon Tandoori masala - Everest brand","100 grams Chicken breasts - cut into 1 cm cubes","Salt - to taste","Water - to knead","1/2 teaspoon Garam masala powder","2 teaspoons Tandoori masala","2 tablespoons Fresh cream","1/2 teaspoon Lemon juice","1/2 teaspoon Red Chilli powder"], product_ids: [2307,4141,973,48,2300,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Tandoori Chicken Momos Recipe, first let’s make the dough.For the Momo doughIn a mixing bowl, add ma","The dough should be non sticky, smooth and firm","Keep the momo dough covered for 2 hours before making filling.To make the Chicken Momo FillingIn a mixing bowl","combine the chicken cubes along with fresh cream, tandoori masala,  garam masala, cumin powder, red chilli powder, chaat","Set aside for 15 minutes","Heat a grill pan on medium-high flame, place the marinated chicken pieces and cook for about 3-4 minutes on each side","Ensuring that the chicken momo filling is cooked","Turn off the heat, transfer the chicken momo filling into a bowl and set aside ✅"] },
