"kashmiri_style_haak_t_thool_recipe_greens_cooked_w": { title: "Kashmiri Style Haak T Thool Recipe - Greens Cooked With Eggs", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Asafoetida (hing)","2 Dry Red Chilli","1 Green Chilli - optional","3 to 4 tablespoons Mustard oil","4 Greens - (collard greens","2 Whole Eggs - hard boiled","Sunflower Oil - as required"], product_ids: [2307,973,4148,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Kashmiri Haak T Thool Recipe, wash the greens nicely and pat dry them ✅"] },
"savoury_baked_arbi_chips_recipe": { title: "Savoury Baked Arbi Chips Recipe", serves: "3", time: "25 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["6 Colocasia root (Arbi) - thinly sliced","Salt - to taste","Amchur (Dry Mango Powder) - to taste (optional)","Black pepper powder - to taste","1 tablespoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil - to toss"], product_ids: [1,2307,2301,2302,2303], steps: ["To begin making Savoury Baked Arbi Chips Recipe, pre heat oven at 400 F / 200 deg CMeanwhile wash, peel and thinly slice","In a small bowl, mix olive oil, amchur (if using), salt and pepper","Rub this mixture into taro slices and toss well so that the spices and oil is coated on the arbi slices.Line a baking tr","Spread chips evenly on the parchment paper","Take care that they do not overlap","Bake for 10-12 minutes","Take them out, toss and again place the baking tray in oven and bake at 160 deg centigrade for 4-5 minutes or ill crisp","Closely monitor the oven after a few minutes since each oven has different temperatures ✅"] },
"gujarati_vaghareli_mag_recipe_whole_green_moong_da": { title: "Gujarati Vaghareli Mag Recipe - Whole Green Moong Dal Sabzi Recipe", serves: "3", time: "430 min", category: "🫘 Dal", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Green Moong Dal (Whole) - soaked overnight","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1 sprig Curry leaves - torn","1 teaspoon Salt - or to taste","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","6 sprig Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","1 Green Chillies - finely chopped or slit","2 inch Ginger - finely chopped","1 teaspoon Sunflower Oil","1 Lemon - juice extracted"], product_ids: [930,2307,2308,973,48,503,920,2300], steps: ["To begin making the Jain Style Whole Green Moong Dal Sabzi or Vagharela Mag, soak the moong dal overnight for about 6-7 ","Pressure cook for 3-4 whistles and turn off the heat","Allow the pressure to release naturally, ensuring the moong dal is soft, tender and still remains grainy but not mushy","Heat oil in a pan on medium heat; add the cumin seeds and allow them to crackle","Stir in the green chillies, curry leaves ginger and turmeric powder, sauté for a few seconds","Turn off the heat and serve warm.Serve Jain Style Whole Green Moong Dal Sabzi Recipe / Vagharela Mag with hot Tawa Parat","Serve Jain Style Whole Green Moong Dal Sabzi for lunch along with Pudina Lahsun Laccha Paratha, Gujarati Wadi Pulao Reci"] },
"gujarati_adadiya_ladwa_recipe_urad_dal_halwa_with": { title: "Gujarati Adadiya Ladwa Recipe - Urad Dal Halwa with Nuts & Spices", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1-3/4 cups Khoya (Mawa) - crumbled","1/2 cup Badam (Almond) - chopped","2 tablespoons Pistachios - chopped","1/3 cup Cashew nuts - chopped","2 tablespoons Cloves (Laung) - powdered","2 tablespoons Cinnamon Powder (Dalchini)","1 1/2 tablespoon Peepramul powder (ganthoda)","1 cup Sugar","2 tablespoons Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","1/2 cup Milk - lukewarm","4 tablespoons Dry ginger powder","2 cups Ghee - + 1/4 cup ghee"], product_ids: [2307,2308,8,2314,4140,4141,503], steps: ["To begin making the Gujarati Adadiya Ladwa Recipe, sieve the flour in a broad flat dish","Sprinkle the lukewarm milk and ghee over the flour a little at a time.With gentle palm pressure of both hands, combine t","The mixture should be such that it should form a lump when you hold it firmly with closed fist.This entire procedure whi","Cover it and keep it in a warm place for at least 3 hours","The purpose of this is to let the flour bind well together.After 3 hours have passed, gently crumble the mixture and the","If you don't have a sieve crumble it between your palms until the mixture feels like coarse crumbs","Keep aside.In a sauce pan add 1 cup of water and prepare sugar syrup of less than 1 thread consistency and keep aside","The purpose of preparing the syrup first is that it cools down before you finally pour it over the hot Adadiya Ladwa mix"] },
