"chilli_cheese_paratha_recipe": { title: "Chilli Cheese Paratha Recipe", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["Ghee - to smear while cooking","2 teaspoon Kalonji (Onion Nigella Seeds)","200 grams Britannia Cheese Block - grated","Salt - to taste","2 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","2 Onions - finely chopped","6 Green Chillies - finely chopped","2 cups Whole Wheat Flour","1/2 cup Mint Leaves (Pudina)"], product_ids: [2307,4140,973,4145,946,2300,476,2302], steps: ["To begin making Chilli Cheese Paratha Recipe, into a mixing bowl add the grated cheese, green chillies, onions, mint lea","Keep aside.To make the dough, into a mixing bowl add the wheat flour, kalonji seeds, salt to taste and add little water ","Take a portion of the dough in flour and roll into a 3 inch diameter circle","Place a large tablespoon of the stuffing in the center of the circle.Bring the edges together and seal the dough","Dust the stuffed ball in flour and roll into a flat paratha","To cook the Chilli Cheese Paratha, place the rolled out cheese paratha on a preheated pan.Warm the paratha for a few sec","Serve Chilli Cheese Paratha Recipe with Aam Ka Achaar  or Garlic Chutney and a bowl of homemade yogurt for a special wee"] },
