"chicken_tikki_recipe": { title: "Chicken Tikki Recipe", serves: "3", time: "25 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["2 tbsp oil - for frying","1 tsp coriander powder","1 onion - finely chopped","2 tbsp rice flour","1 tsp turmeric powder","1/2 tsp cumin powder","1 tbsp garam masala powder","1 tsp ginger garlic paste","1 egg - Whisk","4 sprig green coriander - finely chopped","salt - as per taste","1 cup bread crumbs"], product_ids: [930,2307,973,4143,4148,476,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making Chicken Tikki Recipe, first pour the eggs in a bowl, beat and keep them aside","Now take chicken in a bowl","Add garam masala powder, red chilli powder, turmeric powder, coriander powder, cumin powder and mix well","Now add ginger garlic paste, onion, coriander, rice flour, 1/4 cup bread crumbs, salt And mix well","Now make a lemon size ball of this mixture","Pour these balls into the egg mixture and then coat them with bread crumbs","Now press it flat between the two hands to shape the cutlet","Make sari tikki by doing this ✅"] },
