"banana_almond_butter_bread_recipe": { title: "Banana-Almond Butter Bread Recipe", serves: "3", time: "35 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["5 tablespoons Vivatta Maida","2 tablespoons Chocolate ganache - or melted chocolate","2-1/2 tablespoons Almond butter","1/2 teaspoon Baking powder","1 pinch Salt","1 Whole Egg","1/4 teaspoon Vanilla Extract - or almond extract","1/4 cup Sugar","2 tablespoons Slivered Almonds (Badam)","3 tablespoons Almond Meal (Badam Powder)","1/4 teaspoon Baking soda","1 Ripe Bananas - (over ripe)"], product_ids: [2307,2308,2314,15,4144,4148,27,2300], steps: ["To begin making Banana-Almond Butter Bread Recipe, preheat oven to 170 deg C.In a bowl, mash ripe banana with a fork and","Keep it aside.In stand mixer, add sugar and egg and beat in medium speed till the sugar is dissolved","Add almond butter and mashed banana and beat again, mixture will still be lumpy due to mashed banana.Gradually add flour","Don’t over stir it.Grease the loaf pan or muffin tray and divide the mixture in prepared muffin tray or loaf pan","Drizzle melted chocolate and give a swirl, and also sprinkle almond flakes on top.Place the tray in preheated","Bake for 17-18 minutes, until a toothpick inserted comes out clean and the tops turn golden.Cool in the pan for 10 minut","Serve Banana-Almond Butter Bread Recipe along with a cup of Coffee Recipe With Instant Coffee Powder and Elo Jhelo Nimki"] },
"masala_akki_roti_recipe_spicy_rice_flour_flatbread": { title: "Masala Akki Roti Recipe - Spicy Rice Flour Flatbread", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1/4 cup Dill leaves - finely chopped","1 Carrot (Gajjar) - grated","Salt - to taste","2 Green Chillies - finely chopped","1 Onion - finely chopped","1/4 cup Fresh coconut - grated","2 cups Rice flour","Sunflower Oil - to cook","1/4 teaspoon Asafoetida (hing)","1/2 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1/4 cup Cabbage (Patta Gobi/ Muttaikose) - finely chopped","1 inch Ginger - finely chopped"], product_ids: [2307,9,973,1840,465,468,2300,922], steps: ["The dough should be soft","Grease your palm and place a portion of the dough at the center of the cloth","Using your fingers pat the dough to make circular discs of medium thickness","Make three small holes in the akki roti for even cooking of the akki roti.Preheat a skillet over medium heat and grease ","Carefully invert the akki roti onto the preheated pan and peel out the cloth or the leaf.Cook the Masala Akki Roti on me"] },
