"no_onion_no_garlic_lauki_paneer_kofta_curry_recipe": { title: "No Onion No Garlic Lauki Paneer Kofta Curry Recipe", serves: "3", time: "70 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","2 sprig Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","Sunflower Oil - for cooking","1 Bay leaf (tej patta) - torn","Salt - or rock salt to taste","1/2 teaspoon Coriander Powder (Dhania)","2 cups Tomatoes - cubed","2 Green Chillies - finely chopped","1 Cinnamon Stick (Dalchini)","2 Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds - pounded into powder","1/4 cup Rajgira Flour (Amaranth Flour) - for binding","1/2 cup Curd (Dahi / Yogurt)"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,2308,2314,973,4142,462], steps: ["We begin making No Onion No Garlic Lauki Paneer Kofta Curry Recipe, heat a heavy bottomed pan or kadhai with oil","Add tomatoes, green chillies, cumin seeds, little bit of turmeric powder and salt","Then add the tomato paste with the rest of the spice powders into the curry and cook it for about 5 minutes.Once done ad","Add the koftas after you transfer the gravy into a serving dish so that the koftas do not turn soggy.Serve your mouth-wa"] },
