"light_and_healthy_spinach_soup_recipe": { title: "Light And Healthy Spinach Soup Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍵 Soup", all_ingredients: ["1 Stalk Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - chopped","2 teaspoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Salt - to taste","500 grams Spinach Leaves (Palak) - washed and chopped","1 clove Garlic","1 cup Milk","Black pepper powder - freshly ground to taste","1 cup Vegetable stock - or water"], product_ids: [930,2307,4141,923,2300,2301,2302,2303], steps: ["To begin making the Light and Healthy Spinach Soup Recipe, we will first get all the ingredients ready.Heat oil in large","Add in the chopped spinach, sprinkle some salt and saute on medium heat until the spinach is wilted and cooked.Add all t","Note: If your blender does not take in hot ingredients, then allow the blender to cool completely and then add the ingre","Once blender, pour the Spinach Soup into as sauce pan","Adjust the consistency of the soup by adding more or less milk or water/stock ✅"] },
"malwani_pumpkin_and_raw_mango_curry_recipe": { title: "Malwani Pumpkin And Raw Mango Curry Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["3 Green Chillies","1 Kaddu (Parangikai/ Pumpkin) - yellow one","1/2 teaspoon Whole Black Peppercorns","2 tablespoons Fresh coconut - grated","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1 Mango (Raw) - peeled and diced","2 Dry Red Chillies","1 teaspoon Fennel seeds (Saunf)","1/4 teaspoon Methi Seeds (Fenugreek Seeds)","1/2 teaspoon Coriander (Dhania) Seeds","1 tablespoon Sunflower Oil","1/2 teaspoon Ginger - grated"], product_ids: [1,930,929,2307,9,973,1842,2300], steps: ["To begin making the Malwani Pumpkin And Raw Mango Curry Recipe, lightly dry roast each of these spices separately – drie","Let it cool and then grind into fine powder.Heat oil in a heavy bottomed pan","Add slit green chilies, grated ginger and saute for a minute","Then add the ground powder and saute for a minute.Add raw mango cubes into the pan along with salt along with little wat","Add little water if required during cooking","The Malwani Pumpkin And Raw Mango Curry should be semi dry.Finally add grated coconut and turn off the flame","Serve Malwani Pumpkin And Raw Mango Curry along with Cauliflower Thoran and Steamed Rice for a weekday lunch or dinner ✅"] },
"sweet_chili_orange_chicken_recipe": { title: "Sweet Chili & Orange Chicken Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Corn flour","Salt - to taste","1 Onion - cut into squares","3 tablespoons Red Chilli sauce","1/2 cup Fresh orange juice","3 Chicken breasts","6 cloves Garlic - chopped","Sunflower Oil","1 teaspoon Black pepper powder"], product_ids: [2307,973,16,1842,2300,476,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Sweet Chili & Orange Chicken Recipe, We will heat a flat skillet with oil on medium flame, add garli","Once the Sweet Chili & Orange Chicken is thick, turn off the flame and transfer to a serving bowl and serve hot.Serve th","You can finish off with a Banana Cream Pie Recipe as dessert ✅"] },
"focaccia_bread_with_sweet_onion_and_capers_recipe": { title: "Focaccia Bread with Sweet Onion and Capers Recipe", serves: "3", time: "150 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Sugar","1 teaspoon Active dry yeast","1 Onion - sliced","Salt - to taste","2 teaspoon Capers","4 tablespoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","1 teaspoon Dried oregano","1/4 cup Milk - warmed","1 cup Whole Wheat Flour","1 teaspoon Fresh Thyme leaves"], product_ids: [2307,2314,4141,2300,921,476,2301,2302], steps: ["Make a soft dough.Now sprinkle flour on a flat surface and make the dough soft by kneading with hands for about 10 minut","Make the dough even on all sides by tapping with your hands","I took 4 *4 inches baking tray.Now cover it with a cloth and place it on a warm place till the dough rises","I placed the dough in the oven.Until the dough rises, start preparing the topping","Take 2 tablespoon olive oil in a saucepan and add onions and a teaspoon of sugar and caramelize for 10 minutes","Switch it off and keep it aside.Preheat Oven to 200 degrees Celsius.After 2 hours you can see the dough has risen so wel","Knock it off and add salt and knead well.Place the dough on a greased baking sheet, then place the bread and flatten it","Sprinkle the caramelized onions and add the capers ✅"] },
"baked_bhakarwadi_recipe": { title: "Baked Bhakarwadi Recipe", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","Water - to knead","1 teaspoon Ajwain (Carom seeds)","1/3 cup Sugar","1 cup Gram flour (besan)","1 tablespoon Ghee","Sunflower Oil - spray","1 tablespoon Green Chilli - finely chopped","1/2 cup Dessicated Coconut","Salt - to taste","1 tablespoon Ginger - grated","1 tablespoon Mint Leaves (Pudina) - finely chopped"], product_ids: [930,2307,2308,9,2314,4140,973,48], steps: ["To begin making Baked Bhakarwadi Recipe, in a medium bowl add all the ingredients listed under \"For the Dough\" like th","Add water little by little and knead until you get a firm dough","Cover with a damp cloth and keep aside.Heat up a pan, add poppy seeds and sesame seeds","Roast them on low flame until nice aroma comes out","Once done transfer the seeds to a bowl and keep aside.In the same pan roast dry coconut until slightly golden","Remove that and keep aside","In a mixer add roasted poppy seeds, sesame seeds, coconut and all the other ingredients (Except sugar) listed under \"Fo","Pulse couple of times so that everything is mixed well ✅"] },
"gul_poli_recipe_maharashtrian_jaggery_sesame_stuff": { title: "Gul Poli Recipe (Maharashtrian Jaggery & Sesame Stuffed Flatbread)", serves: "3", time: "80 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1 cup All Purpose Flour (Maida)","1 tablespoon Sunflower Oil - hot","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","Lukewarm Water - as required","1 cup Whole Wheat Flour","3/4 cup Jaggery","1-1/2 tablespoon Ghee","1-1/2 tablespoon Gram flour (besan)","Ghee - to serve","2-1/2 tablespoon Sesame seeds (Til seeds)","2 teaspoon Water"], product_ids: [2307,2308,2314,4140,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making Gul Poli recipe, we will first make the dove to prepare the poli (flat bread)","In a large mixing bowl, mix the wheat flour and the all purpose flour along with salt.Heat 1 tablespoon oil in a tadka p","Make a well in the middle of the flour mixture","Pour hot oil in it","Add warm water to make a soft dough","Knead the dough well","Keep aside covered with a wet cloth","We will now proceed to make the filling for the Gul Poli.Take a mixing bowl.Grate the jaggery in it ✅"] },
"vatana_bateta_na_rotla_recipe_gujarati_peas_and_po": { title: "Vatana Bateta Na Rotla Recipe - Gujarati Peas and Potato Roti", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Sugar","2 teaspoon Lemon juice","3/4 cup Rice flour","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","Salt - to taste","1/4 cup Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","1 cup Green peas (Matar) - coarsely ground","2 inch Ginger - grated","1 tablespoon Sesame seeds (Til seeds)","4 Potatoes (Aloo) - boiled and grated","1/4 teaspoon Asafoetida (hing)","Sunflower Oil - as needed"], product_ids: [930,2307,9,2314,973,48,503,473], steps: ["To begin making the Vatana Bateta Na Rotla Recipe, in a mixing bowl, add the rice flour and add 1 tablespoon oil to it","Using your hand rub the oil to the flour to make a coarse crumb like mixture.Add the grated potatoes, grated coconut, gr","Combine all the ingredients, check the salt and adjust to suit your taste","Now add the coarsely ground peas to the mixture and give it a gentle mix.Place a flat non stick skillet pan on medium he","Once the oil heats up, put the Vatana Bateta No Rotla mixture in the pan and flatten it down so that the mixture fills u","once you notice the rotla is getting set and is getting baked in the pan, using a flat spatula and flip to cook on the o","(It's tricky but you should be able to get it right with practice).Let the crust form on the other side as well ✅"] },
