"gluten_free_mango_and_coconut_milk_ice_cream_recip": { title: "Gluten-Free Mango and Coconut Milk Ice-Cream Recipe", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["500 grams Mango (Ripe)","200 ml Coconut milk","Mint Leaves (Pudina) - Few sprigs to garnish","200 grams Condensed Milk"], product_ids: [1,946,4141,9], steps: ["To prepare the Mango and Coconut Milk Ice Cream, first keep all the ingredients in the fridge to chill for few hours.Nex","Transfer the mango puree into a mixing bowl.Next combine the pureed mango, condensed milk and coconut milk","Whisk using a hand blender at medium speed for few minutes or till light and creamy in texture.Now pour the ice-cream mi","Once the ice cream is almost frozen approximately after 4 - 5 hours, bring it out of the freezer and blend in a food pro","Pour again into the container and keep it back in the freezer.Doing the freeze and re-beating process, helps the ice cre","The more we beat, the more creamy it gets","Once you have freeze and beat process 3 times over, then your Mango and Coconut Milk Ice Cream will be ready to be serve","You can also optionally add freshly chopped mangoes and nut to add to the flavour, texture and crunch ✅"] },
