"roasted_eggplant_parmigiana_recipe": { title: "Roasted Eggplant Parmigiana Recipe", serves: "3", time: "75 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["1/4 cup Whole Wheat Bread crumbs","2 sprigs Basil leaves - roughly torn","2 Brinjal (Baingan / Eggplant)","Salt and Pepper - to taste","200 grams Mozzarella cheese - cut into 1/8 inch pieces","2 cups Tomato Basil Pasta Sauce","1/2 cup Parmigiano reggiano cheese - grated"], product_ids: [545,2307,4143,4145,4148,469,2302,927], steps: ["To begin making the Roasted Eggplant Parmigiana Recipe, season the eggplant slices with salt and allow them to rest for ","During the resting process the eggplants release water and this indicates that they are ready for grilling.Grease a cast","Place the salt marinated eggplants onto the preheated grill.Allow them to grill in the pan for a few seconds and then fl","Cover the pan and allow the eggplant to grill and get tender on medium heat","After a couple of minutes of grilling, flip them over to the other side and grill until tender and lightly roasted","Remove them from the pan, keep them aside and proceed the same way with the remaining eggplants.At this stage preheat th","Over each eggplant, place a sliced mozzarella cheese.Next spoon the tomato basil sauce over each of the slices","Then sprinkle some grated Parmigiano cheese ✅"] },
