"roasted_bell_pepper_rasam_recipe": { title: "Roasted Bell Pepper Rasam Recipe", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🍵 Soup", all_ingredients: ["1 Dry Red Chilli","1 Tomato","1 cup Tamarind Water","1 tablespoon Rasam Powder","1/2 cup Arhar dal (Split Toor Dal) - cooked","1 teaspoon Whole Black Peppercorns - crushed","1 teaspoon Mustard seeds","2 cloves Garlic - crushed","1 tablespoon Sunflower Oil","1 Green Bell Pepper (Capsicum) - roasted","1 teaspoon Fennel seeds (Saunf) - crushed","1 sprig Curry leaves"], product_ids: [545,2307,2308,2311,973,1840,1842,503], steps: ["In a saucepan, combine the bell peppers, tomatoes, curry leaves and water, bring to a rolling boil on high heat","Allow this to boil","Next pressure cook the dal along with 1/3 cup of water for about 3 whistles","Turn off the flame and allow the pressure to release naturally","Open the pressure cooker and transfer the dal into to the boiling bell pepper mixture","Let the rasam boil for another 10 more minutes.To make the tempering, heat a small pan with oil on medium heat, crackle ","Pour it over the rasam and serve","Serve the Roasted Bell Pepper Rasam Recipe along with steamed rice, Sweet Corn Poriyal and Mushroom Thoran Recipe for a "] },
