"doi_bhetki_recipe_bengali_style_yogurt_fish_curry": { title: "Doi Bhetki Recipe - Bengali Style Yogurt Fish Curry", serves: "3", time: "70 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","8 cloves Garlic","1 tablespoon Coriander Powder (Dhania)","1 teaspoon Black pepper powder","2 Onions","6 Green Chillies","1 teaspoon Garam masala powder","Salt - to taste","2 Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds","3/4 cup Curd (Dahi / Yogurt)","2 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","1 Bay leaf (tej patta)"], product_ids: [930,2307,2314,973,4142,2300,476,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Doi Bhetki Recipe, clean and wash fish pieces well","Add 1 teaspoon turmeric powder, 1 teaspoon red chili powder and salt to taste.Rub this spice mix well on both sides of t","Cover and marinate for 30 minutes.Grind onions, green chilies, ginger, and garlic into smooth paste adding little water ","Fry few pieces of fish at a time on medium flame on both sides","Remove the fish from the pan and drain in on paper towel.Now, add 2 tablespoon of the same oil in which fish was fried i","Add cloves, cardamom and bay leaf.Add the onion-chilli-ginger-garlic paste and cook until the raw smell of the paste is ","It will take about 10 to 15 minutes.Now add all the spice powders including turmeric powder, cumin powder, red chilli po","Add 1 cup water, mix well and bring it to boil.Now add whisked yogurt, salt to taste and mix again ✅"] },
