"vegetable_pasta_soup_recipe": { title: "Vegetable Pasta Soup Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍵 Soup", all_ingredients: ["2 tablespoon Tomato Ketchup","1 teaspoon Paprika powder - or red chilli flakes","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","2 tablespoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","1/2 cup Kabuli Chana (White Chickpeas) - uncooked","1/2 teaspoon Whole Black Peppercorns - crushed","2 Tomatoes - diced","Salt - to taste","4 cups Water","1 Onion - chopped","1/2 cup Pasta - whole wheat rotini","4 cloves Garlic - chopped"], product_ids: [545,2303,2307,2308,2314,973,4143,1842], steps: ["To begin with Vegetable Pasta Soup, heat olive oil in a pan and add garlic & onion","Cook it for about 1-2 minutes.After 1-2 minutes, add all remaining ingredients except pasta","Cook the mixture for 10 minutes or until vegetables are soft and tender.After 10 minutes, add the rotini pasta and cook ","Season the delicious soup with more salt and pepper if required.Serve Vegetable Pasta Soup along with Beetroot Salad Rec"] },
"mor_milagai_recipe_south_indian_sun_dried_chillies": { title: "Mor Milagai Recipe - South Indian Sun Dried Chillies", serves: "3", time: "10 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["1/4 cup Water","100 grams Green Chillies","1 cup Curd (Dahi / Yogurt) - thick","2 tablespoons Salt"], product_ids: [2302,2314,973,4142], steps: ["To begin making the Mor Milagai, first wash the green chillies well and allow it to dry completely by wiping it in a clo","Also, keep the stems, and don't remove them","Slitting of the chillies helps the chillies to absorb curd/ yogurt easily","In a large mixing bowl, add the curd, water and salt","Whisk well and add the chillies","Stir well with a clean ladle and avoid using your hands","We need to now marinate the chillies in a bottle.Place the Mor Milagai, along with the curd mixture into a clean bottle","Cover the bottle and keep aside in the kitchen counter ✅"] },
