"how_to_make_tutty_fruity_recipe": { title: "How to Make Tutty Fruity Recipe", serves: "3", time: "80 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["300 grams Raw papaya - cleaned and chopped finely","1 teaspoon Vanilla Extract","300 grams Sugar","1/4 teaspoon Saffron strands"], product_ids: [2314,12,2300], steps: ["You can also add food color if you want","Divide the mixture, put in separate bowls to add various colors","Let these papaya pieces absorb the color and sugar syrup for next 16-24 hours","Cover and keep aside","Toss for every few hours for the color to be even.After the soaking time, take out the papayas and place them on a wire ","This is to drain out any extra syrup and dry the pieces and be freed of stickiness completely","This process speeds up under the sun","It may take 2-3 days depending on the temperature, humidity and the sunlight.After that, you can store the Tutti Fruity "] },
