"spiced_beetroot_buttermilk_recipe": { title: "Spiced Beetroot Buttermilk Recipe", serves: "3", time: "25 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["2 Green Chilli","1/2 teaspoon Mustard seeds","2 cups Curd (Dahi / Yogurt)","2 sprig Curry leaves","1 inch Ginger - chopped","Salt - to taste","1/4 teaspoon Chaat Masala Powder","1 teaspoon Sunflower Oil","2 cups Water","2 Beetroots - peeled and chopped"], product_ids: [2307,2314,973,4142,470,920,2300,2301], steps: ["To Begin Making Spiced Beetroot Buttermilk first put the beetroot in a pressure cooker and half a cup of water and boil ","Let the pressure release naturally and let the beetroot cool.Once the beetroot is cooled blend it in a blender along wit","Strain the pureed beetroot mixture through a strainer into a bowl","In another big bowl whisk the curd and then add salt, chaat masala, pureed beetroot and water.Heat oil in a tadka pan ov","Once it crackles, turn off heat","Spoon seasoning to the prepared Beetroot buttermilk and mix.Check the taste and adjust the salt and seasonings according","Once done, you can serve the beetroot buttermilk immediately or refrigerate it for a few hours and serve chilled ✅"] },
"north_east_khapse_recipe_deep_fried_biscuits_from": { title: "North East Khapse Recipe (Deep Fried Biscuits From Arunachal)", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["2 cups All Purpose Flour (Maida)","1/4 cup Sunflower Oil - & more to deep fry","3 tablespoon Sugar","1/2 cup Milk"], product_ids: [2301,2314,4141], steps: ["To begin making North East Khapse Recipe (Deep Fried Biscuits From Arunachal), dissolve the sugar in 1/2 cup of warm wat","Combine flour, oil, sugar water and milk in a mixing bowl.Mix everything together to make a smooth ball of dough","Roll out the dough to about a 1/4 inch thickness.Cut the dough in strips and slice a slot in the middle of each piece ✅"] },
"pea_and_spring_onion_soup_recipe": { title: "Pea And Spring Onion Soup Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍵 Soup", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Spring Onion Greens - roughly chopped","2 tablespoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Salt - to taste","500 ml Vegetable stock","2 teaspoon Black pepper powder","4 cloves Garlic - smashed","2 tablespoon Fresh cream","Black pepper powder - to taste","4 - 5 Spring Onion (Bulb & Greens) - chopped","2 cup Green peas (Matar) - steamed"], product_ids: [2307,4141,2300,503,2301,476,925,2302], steps: ["To begin making Pea And Spring Onion Soup, separate greens from spring onion","Chop the spring onion and set aside","Similarly chop the spring onion greens and keep in a separate bowl.In a large pot simmer vegetable stock over low flame ","Sauté until onion turn translucent but not brown for about 1 to 2 minutes.Once cooked the spring onions are through, add","Season with salt and pepper.Puree the green peas mixture in a mixer along with the vegetable stock into a smooth puree","Check the salt and pepper and adjust to suit your taste.When you are ready to serve the Pea and Spring Onion Soup , brin","Serve Pea And Spring Onion Soup along with Whole Wheat Rosemary Focaccia Bread as a weeknight meal appetizer ✅"] },
"baked_crisp_whole_wheat_methi_puri_recipe_healthy": { title: "Baked & Crisp Whole Wheat Methi Puri Recipe (Healthy Snack)", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1/4 cup Ghee","2 tablespoons Kasuri Methi (Dried Fenugreek Leaves)","1 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Kalonji (Onion Nigella Seeds)","2 cups Whole Wheat Flour","1 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1/2 teaspoon Red Chilli powder"], product_ids: [929,2307,4140,973,2300,476,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Whole Wheat Methi Puri Recipe, combine all the ingredients in a large mixing bowl","Add the ghee as well into the flour mixture and you will notice it will form a crumb like texture.Check the salt levels ","You can optionally add chilli powder or crushed black pepper to add to the spice.Gradually add little water at a time an","It should be more firm than the roti dough","Preheat the oven to 180 C","Dust the baking sheets with flour and keep aside.Next, roll the  Methi Puri (Mathri) Dough into a large circle, using a ","At home we like our puris to be on the thinner side ✅"] },
"pumpkin_chapati_recipe": { title: "Pumpkin Chapati Recipe", serves: "3", time: "35 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["Ghee - or oil for cooking","Sunflower Oil - for kneading","1/2 teaspoon Salt","1 cup Whole Wheat Flour","200 grams Kaddu (Parangikai/ Pumpkin) - boiled and mashed"], product_ids: [4140,2301,2302,2300], steps: ["Add one tablespoon of oil to coat the dough and knead again","Cover and set aside for 15 minutes.Knead once again and divide the dough into 8 portions","Preheat the iron skillet on medium heat.Roll the paratha dough portions into balls and flatten them with the palm of you","Toss them on flour and roll them out into circles of approximately 3 inches in diameter","Put 1/4 teaspoon oil and spread it on the rolled dough.We need to get a triangle shape, to do so, first fold into a semi","You get a mini triangle shape","Tossing the triangle on a little flour, roll it out gently into a larger triangle","Continue the same process of rolling with the remaining dough portions.With skillet on medium high heat, place one rolle"] },
"vepilakatti_lime_leaves_pickle_recipe": { title: "Vepilakatti - Lime Leaves Pickle Recipe", serves: "3", time: "25 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["1/2 teaspoon Asafoetida (hing) - powder","3 Shallots","Salt - to taste","Tamarind - small ball","2 Dry Red Chillies - (adjust)","10 Kaffir lime leaves - or lemon leaves","5 Curry leaves"], product_ids: [2307,2311,973,48,2300,920,476,2302], steps: ["To begin making Veppilakatti - Lime Leaves Pickle Recipe, wash the Kaffir lime leaves & curry leaves, pat them dry.Dry r","Keep aside.Tear the stem of the kaffir lemon leaf.Add all the ingredients like the kaffir lime leaves, roasted red chill","Do not add water","I ground coarsely like it is done traditionally","You can also blend into a fine paste.Make them into small balls and store them in an airtight container.Serve Veppilakat"] },
"khaman_dhokla_poha_recipe": { title: "Khaman Dhokla Poha Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍚 Rice", all_ingredients: ["Sunflower Oil - for cooking","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - Few sprigs finely chopped","2 Green Chillies - finely chopped","1 Onion - finely chopped","1/4 cup Fresh coconut - grated","1/4 teaspoon Asafoetida (hing)","2 cups Khaman dhokla - crumbled","1 tablespoon Mustard seeds"], product_ids: [930,2307,9,973,2300,476,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Khaman Dhokla Poha Recipe, use leftover dhokla.Here is the recipe for the Khaman Dhokla Recipe if yo","Turn off the heat and garnish with coriander leaves and serve.Serve Khaman Dhokla Poha with Pudina Chutney and a cup of "] },
"singhare_atte_ka_halwa_sheera_recipe_water_chestnu": { title: "Singhare Atte Ka Halwa/Sheera Recipe (Water Chestnut Flour Halwa Recip", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["2 teaspoons Cardamom Powder (Elaichi) - freshly ground","1/4 cup Cashew nuts - halved","1 cup Sugar","1 cup Singoda Flour (Water Chestnut)","3 cups Water","1 cup Ghee - + 1 tablespoon"], product_ids: [2314,2307,4140,2300], steps: ["To begin making the Singhare Atte Ka Halwa/Sheera Recipe (Water Chestnut Flour Halwa Recipe) , heat the water and sugar ","Continue to roast until the mixture begins to release a roasted aroma and changes colour to a roasted brown; the process","The mixture will begin to resemble like coarse crumbles","Turn the heat to low and stir the cardamom powder to the singhare flour mixture.Slowly start stirring in the prepared su","The mixture will start splitting and curdling.Continue stirring until the mixture thickens, but yet feels coarse and not"] },
