"healthy_ragi_energy_balls_with_strawberry_recipe": { title: "Healthy Ragi Energy Balls with Strawberry Recipe", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["250 grams Strawberries - fresh","1/4 teaspoon Salt","Sunflower Oil - few drops for greasing","5 tablespoons Fresh coconut - grated (fresh)","1 cup Ragi Flour (Finger Millet/ Nagli)"], product_ids: [9,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Healthy Ragi Energy Balls with Strawberry Recipe, first wash and clean strawberries.Using blender/mi","Keep the strawberry puree aside, while we proceed to prepare the ragi mixture for the energy balls.In a mixing bowl, add","Add salt, sprinkle little water at a time and make a crumble out of the ragi flour","Add a little water at a time to moisten to the flour slowly","Be patient in doing this procedure","You know its of the right consistency, when you hold the flour tightly in the palm of your hands it will hold itself and","Place the ragi flour mixture in a steamer or Idli pot or a Puttu maker for about 10 minutes on high heat.Once the ragi m","Add the grated coconut and the strawberry pulp ✅"] },
