"khira_gaintha_recipe_rice_dumplings_in_sweetened_m": { title: "Khira Gaintha Recipe - Rice Dumplings In Sweetened Milk", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Rice flour","Mixed nuts - chopped","1/4 cup Cashew nuts - powdered","1 pinch Salt","2 cups Water","1/2 cup Sugar","1 liter Milk","1 tablespoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)"], product_ids: [2314,2307,4141,2302], steps: ["To begin making Khira Gaintha Recipe - Rice Dumplings In Sweetened Milk, soak the rice in water for about 5 to 6 hours","Then wash and drain the water from rice and dry them under a fan and keep it aside","Grind the rice to a fine mixture","You can use the rice powder also for this recipe.Boil water in a deep pan","Add a tsp of oil and salt to this","Now gradually add the rice flour to the water and keep stirring","Make sure there aren’t any lumps","Lower the flame, cover the pan with a lid and cook it for five minutes.Transfer this mixture to a plate ✅"] },
