"pumpkin_stew_with_chickpeas_recipe": { title: "Pumpkin Stew With Chickpeas Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1 Carrot (Gajjar) - diced","2 cups Kaddu (Parangikai/ Pumpkin) - cut into cubes","1 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","1 cup Homemade tomato puree","1 cup Kabuli Chana (White Chickpeas) - soaked overnight","Salt - to taste","4 cloves Garlic - finely chopped","1 teaspoon Coriander Powder (Dhania)","1 teaspoon Cinnamon Powder (Dalchini)","2 tablespoons Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - chopped","1 Onion - finely chopped","1 teaspoon Red Chilli flakes"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,2308,2314,973,48,468], steps: ["To begin making Pumpkin Stew With Chickpeas Recipe, prep all the ingredients and keep them ready","Soak the chickpeas overnight or for at least 8 hours","Once the onions have softened, add in the carrot and pumpkin, sprinkle salt to taste and a little water, cover and cook ","Add a little water if required to adjust the consistency of the stew accordingly","Check the salt and seasonings and adjust according to taste.After the brisk boil for a couple of minutes, stir in the bl","Transfer the Pumpkin Stew With Chickpeas Recipe to a serving bowl and serve hot.Serve Pumpkin Stew With Chickpeas Recipe"] },
