"bitter_gourd_chips_recipe": { title: "Bitter Gourd Chips Recipe", serves: "3", time: "20 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon red chilli powder","3/4 tablespoon corn flour","1 teaspoon coriander powder","1 bitter gourd","1/2 teaspoon cumin powder","oil - for frying","1/2 teaspoon fennel - crush","salt - as per taste","1/2 teaspoon turmeric powder","1 rice flour","1/4 small Tablespoon raw mango","1 tablespoon gram flour"], product_ids: [1,930,2307,2308,973,1842,2300,2301], steps: ["To make bitter gourd chips, first wash and dry the bitter gourd thoroughly","Cut off the last part of the bitter gourd and throw it","Now cut the bitter gourd into thin thin rounds","Now add bitter gourd, rice flour, gram flour, corn flour, coriander powder, cumin powder, fennel, raw mango, red chilli ","Add a little water and mix well","Heat oil in a pan","After the oil is hot, add the bitter gourd slices one by one","Cook it on both sides of the karela until it becomes crisp ✅"] },
"beetroot_rosti_recipe": { title: "Beetroot Rosti Recipe", serves: "3", time: "25 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["Salt - to taste","Dill leaves - chopped","4 tablespoons Butter - or oil as needed","3 tablespoon Whole Wheat Flour - or maida","4 tablespoons Sour cream - as required","1 Beetroot - peeled and grated coarsely","1 Potato (Aloo) - parboiled","1 Whole Egg - whisked","3 tablespoons Dill leaves - chopped (or any other herb of choice)","Spring Onion Greens - chopped","1 teaspoon Black pepper powder"], product_ids: [2301,2307,4141,4142,4144,4148,2300,470], steps: ["To begin making Beetroot Rosti recipe, first parboil the potato by drop it in boiling water for about 7-8 minutes","The cooking time may change depending on the quality of potato","If should be firm but partially cooked","Once done, mix the grated beetroot and potatoes in a mixing bowl","Add egg, salt, pepper, dill, and flour","Adjust the amount of flour if you think the mixture is too wet.Heat butter or oil in a non-stick pan","Place the beetroot mixture in the pan and pat evenly to make a large pancake.Cook till the bottom is crisp and starts br","Carefully flip rösti onto the plate ✅"] },
"stuffed_mushrooms_with_spinach_parmesan_recipe": { title: "Stuffed Mushrooms With Spinach & Parmesan Recipe", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Salt - to taste","1/2 teaspoon Dried oregano","1 tablespoon Parmesan cheese - grated","3 Garlic - pods","1 Onion - finely chopped","200 grams Spinach - roughly chopped","2 tablespoons Mozzarella cheese - shredded","20 Button mushrooms","1 tablespoon Whole Wheat Bread crumbs - preferably Italian","1/2 teaspoon Red Bell pepper (Capsicum) - crushed"], product_ids: [2307,4143,1840,4145,2300,1850,923,476], steps: ["To begin making the Stuffed Mushrooms With Spinach And Parmesan Recipe, wash and clean the mushrooms","Separate the stems from the mushrooms and take care not to break the cap of the mushrooms","We will be using the cap to stuff the mushrooms with the filling.Chop the mushrooms stems that you had removed and keep ","Heat olive oil in a heavy bottomed pan; add the chopped onions, garlic, salt and saute until transparent","Add the chopped mushroom stems and the chopped spinach and stir well","Stir fry until the spinach is cooked and the moisture is evaporated","Once cooked through, turn off the heat and add the crushed red pepper, grated parmesan, dry oregano, Italian bread crumb","Check the salt and spice levels and adjust to suit your taste.Once cooked through, turn off the heat and add the crushed"] },
"broccoli_cream_kofta_recipe": { title: "Broccoli Cream Kofta Recipe", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["100 grams Paneer (Homemade Cottage Cheese) - crumbled","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","Sunflower Oil - for cooking","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Garam masala powder","1/2 cup Hung Curd (Greek Yogurt)","1 inch Ginger - grated","1 teaspoon Coriander Powder (Dhania)","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","1 tablespoon Kasuri Methi (Dried Fenugreek Leaves)","1 teaspoon Honey"], product_ids: [545,930,929,2307,2308,2314,973,4142], steps: ["To begin making the Broccoli Malai Kofta Recipe, combine all the ingredients for the kofta in a large bowl","Adjust the salt to suit your taste","Make bite-size broccoli malai kofta balls and keep aside.There are two ways we can cook these koftas without deep frying","If you plan to bake the kofta's; then place the kofta balls on a greased baking sheet","Brush the kofta balls with some oil and bake in a preheated oven (200 C) until the koftas turn golden brown in colour","Remove the kofta's from the oven once baked and keep them aside.The Second is the Kuzhi Paniyaram Pan Method","If you plan to use the Kuzhi Paniyaram Pan; then place the kofta balls in the pan's cavities; drizzle the kofta's with a","You will have to flip the kofta balls so they fry on all sides evenly ✅"] },
"sweet_potato_flatbread_recipe_sweet_potato_chapati": { title: "Sweet Potato Flatbread Recipe - Sweet Potato Chapati", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Red Chilli powder","1 tablespoon Ajwain (Carom seeds)","1 cup Sweet Potato - boiled and mashed","Salt - to taste","1 tablespoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1 cup Whole Wheat Flour"], product_ids: [2307,973,473,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Sweet Potato Flatbread recipe, boil sweet potatoes in a pressure cooker till firm and smash them usi","Use 1 cup of mashed sweet potato for each cup of wheat flour.Take a big bowl, add wheat flour, sweet potato, salt, red c","Cover it with a cotton cloth and let it rest for 10 mins.Now using chapati roller, make a round shape roti or chapati","Heat pan and flip the roti on both sides","Drizzle little oil to get mild golden colour","When it is cooked, switch off the stove and serve hot.Serve Sweet Potato Flatbread along with Boondi Raita and Aam Ka Ac"] },
