"eggless_peach_cobbler_recipe": { title: "Eggless Peach Cobbler Recipe", serves: "3", time: "75 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["100 grams Butter - cut into small pieces","1/4 cup Water - boiled","1-1/2 cup All Purpose Flour (Maida) - or whole wheat flour","4 tablespoon Sugar","1 teaspoon Corn flour","8 Peaches - peeled","1 teaspoon Lemon juice","1/4 teaspoon Nutmeg","1-1/2 teaspoon Cinnamon Powder (Dalchini)","1/4 cup Brown Sugar (Demerara Sugar)","1/4 cup Sugar","1/4 cup Caster Sugar"], product_ids: [2307,2308,2314,48,4144,1842,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin with, the Eggless Peach Cobbler Recipe, wash the peaches and peel their skin off","Cut them into pieces and place them in a mixing bowl.In the meanwhile preheat the Oven to 220 Degree Celsius.Add cinnamo","Toss the peaches around so that they are well coated with spices and cornstarch","Place them on a non-greased baking tray and bake for 10 minutes","They will be little soft after ten minutes of baking.Now in an another bowl add brown sugar and white caster sugar along","You can even use the whole wheat flour","Add cold butter cubes to the dry ingredients and using your fingertips spread the butter","Serve the Eggless Peach Cobbler with some vanilla ice cream or chocolate ice cream ✅"] },
