"chicken_rendang_recipe_malaysian_indonesian_chicke": { title: "Chicken Rendang Recipe - Malaysian-Indonesian Chicken Stew", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["1/2 Fresh coconut - grated","4 cloves Garlic","1 inch Cinnamon Stick (Dalchini)","Salt - to taste","1 Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds","2 Onions - sliced","200 ml Coconut milk","2 cloves Cloves (Laung)","300 grams Chicken breasts - cut into 1 inch cubes","1 Stalk Lemon Grass - white portion only","2 Stalk Lemon Grass - tender white portion only","1 inch Ginger - or galangal"], product_ids: [2307,2308,9,2314,4141,973,48,476], steps: ["To begin making the Chicken Rendang Recipe we will first make the spice paste","To make the spice paste for Chicken RendangIn a saucepan, heat 1/2 cup of water, add the dry red chillies and bring it t","Turn off the flame and let the chillies cool, drain the excess water and set aside","Once the chillies have cooled down split each of them into two, and deseed, ensure all the seeds are completely removed","Transfer to a bowl and set aside","In a mixer jar, combine the boiled and deseed chillies, onions, ginger, garlic, and  lemon grass and grind into a paste","Add some water if required to get a thick spice paste and set aside","This will take a good 5-7 minutes ✅"] },
"chocolate_and_oats_christmas_cookie_cake_recipe": { title: "Chocolate And Oats Christmas Cookie Cake Recipe", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["5 grams Pitted Cherries - chopped into small pieces","5 gram Kiwi","250 gram Chocolate chips","2 cups Instant Oats (Oatmeal)","2 tablespoons Chocolate chips","1/2 cup Milk","3 tablespoons Butter","1/2 teaspoon Vanilla Extract","1/2 cup Condensed Milk","50 gram Pitted Cherries","1/2 cup Raisins"], product_ids: [8,4144,2300,4141], steps: ["To begin making Chocolate And Oats Christmas Cookie Cake Recipe we will make the cookie cake first","Measure all the quantities and store in small bowls.In a pot add water and bring it to a boil on low heat","Once the water is boiling, keep a wide bowl on top of the boiling pot of water","This is called the double boiler method","Add the chocolate chips and butter.Once the butter and chocolate has melted, turn off the boiling water and add in the v","When the milk gets warm add the oats","Stir for few minutes until the milk is totally absorbed into the oats","Pour in the chocolate mixture along with the chopped cherries and raisins for about 10 minutes ✅"] },
