"moong_dal_sookhi_sabzi_recipe": { title: "Moong Dal Sookhi Sabzi Recipe", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🫘 Dal", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Red Chilli powder","1 tablespoon Lemon juice","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1 Green Chilli","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Garam masala powder","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - as required to garnish","1 cup Yellow Moong Dal (Split)","2 tablespoon Sunflower Oil"], product_ids: [930,2307,2308,973,48,503,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making Moong Dal Sookhi Sabzi, first wash the Moong dal and set it aside.Heat oil in a deep pan and add red chi","Stir it for 10-12 seconds","Do not let the spice powders burn.After 10-12 seconds, add the washed lentil to this and give it a good stir.Add enough ","Check if the dal is cooked, if not add a little more water and cook till the dal is cooked properly.Make sure that you d","Once done, open the lid, turn the heat to high, add garam masala powder and give it a good stir.Saute the Moong Dal Sook"] },
