"thai_pineapple_vegetarian_fried_rice_recipe_no_oni": { title: "Thai Pineapple Vegetarian Fried Rice Recipe (No Onion No Garlic)", serves: "3", time: "35 min", category: "🍚 Rice", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Sugar","1 cup Tomatoes - chopped","1/4 cup Dry Fruits - I used black grapes and almonds","1 teaspoon Garam masala powder","Salt - to taste","2 tablespoon Butter","2 cups Cooked rice","1/2 teaspoon Black pepper powder","1 teaspoon Soya sauce","1 cup Pineapple - chopped into cubes","1/2 cup Green peas (Matar)","1 Green Chilli - chopped"], product_ids: [0,545,2307,2311,8,2314,460,973], steps: ["To prepare Thai Pineapple Vegetarian Fried Rice Recipe (No Onion No Garlic), get ready with all the ingredients first","In a large Wok, add butter and heat","Switch off flame after a couple of minutes.Garnish the Thai Pineapple Vegetarian Fried Rice with coriander leaves and mo","Serve the Thai Pineapple Vegetarian Fried Rice hot for your one pot dinner along with Vegetarian Thai Massaman Curry Rec"] },
"peas_pulao_recipe_north_indian_matar_pulao": { title: "Peas Pulao Recipe - North Indian Matar Pulao", serves: "3", time: "35 min", category: "🍚 Rice", all_ingredients: ["1 Onion - sliced","1 inch Cinnamon Stick (Dalchini)","Salt - to taste","2 Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds","1/2 cup Green peas (Matar)","1 tablespoon Ghee","1 Bay leaf (tej patta)","2 Cloves (Laung)","1-1/2 cup Basmati rice","1 Star anise","1/2 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)"], product_ids: [2307,2308,2314,4140,2300,503,476,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Peas Pulao Recipe, wash the rice and soak in water for about 20 minutes","Heat a pressure cooker with ghee on medium flame, to this add the whole spices - bay leaf, cumin seeds, star anise, card","Once these spices begin to sizzle, add the sliced onions, and cook them only until they begin to sweat","This will take about a minute","To this add the salt, green peas and drained rice","Top the matar pulao with about 2-1/2 of water, depending on the age and quality of your rice and close the pressure cook","Pressure cook for about 3 whistles and turn off the flame, allow the pressure to release naturally ✅"] },
