"herbed_brown_rice_recipe": { title: "Herbed Brown Rice Recipe", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["4 teaspoon Red Chilli flakes","1-1/2 cups Brown Rice","Water - for cooking","Salt - to taste","3 teaspoon Rosemary","4 cloves Garlic - finely chopped","3 teaspoon Dried oregano","2 Onions - finely chopped","Sunflower Oil"], product_ids: [2307,460,973,2300,476,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Herbed Brown Rice Recipe, soak the brown rice for 1/2 an hour in 2-1/2 cups of water.keep the pressu","Add in chopped onion and saute till they turn golden brown","Add your washed brown rice into the cooker along with the soaked water, sprinkle all the seasoning like red chilli flake","Pressure cook the herbed brown rice for 3 whistles on high heat and turn the heat to low","Simmer the herbed brown rice for another 5 minutes and turn off the heat.Once done, allow the pressure to release natura","Sprinkle some more herbs and serve","Serve the Herbed Brown Rice Recipe along with Chicken Curry With Sweet Potatoes and Red Cabbage Carrot, Sprout And Onion"] },
