"whole_wheat_mushroom_spinach_calzone_recipe": { title: "Whole Wheat Mushroom Spinach Calzone Recipe", serves: "3", time: "190 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Sugar","1-1/2 cup Whole Wheat Flour","Salt - to taste","1/4 cup Water - lukewarm + extra if needed","Black pepper powder - to taste","1 Onion - finely chopped","5 cloves Garlic - grated","1/2 cup Ricotta Cheese","1 teaspoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","200 grams Button mushrooms","1/2 cup Mozzarella cheese","1 tablespoon Active dry yeast"], product_ids: [2307,2314,4141,4145,2300,1850,923,476], steps: ["For making the spinach mushroom stuffing:To begin making Whole Wheat Mushroom Spinach Calzone, first start preparing the","Place a pan on medium heat and add 1 teaspoon of olive oil in it","Add grated garlic and saute for 10 seconds","Add finely chopped onions and cook till onions turn soft","Do not brown the onions.Now add chopped mushrooms and cook on low flame","Mushrooms will start to release a lot of water","After about a minute add the chopped spinach","Add salt and pepper powder to taste ✅"] },
