"turmeric_amla_ginger_juice_indonesian_jamu_recipe": { title: "Turmeric Amla Ginger Juice - Indonesian Jamu Recipe | Anti Inflammator", serves: "3", time: "20 min", category: "🥤 Smoothie", all_ingredients: ["200 grams Amla (Nellikai/ Gooseberry)","1/2 cup Honey - or to taste","250 grams Fresh turmeric root","1 liter Water","1 teaspoon Black pepper powder","100 grams Ginger"], product_ids: [0,2314,2307,2300], steps: ["To begin making the Indonesian Jamu recipe, first it is important to understand how to prep the ingredients","Using a food processor helps to really simplify the process of grating and juicing","Add one cup of water and blend to make a smooth paste","Strain and extract more juice from the pulp.Do this another two or three times, by blending the pulp along with more wat","This ensures we have taken out the maximum juice and potency from the turmeric, ginger and amla.You will approximately u","The juice extracted will be of the right potency to consume","You will not have to dilute more to drink the Indonesian Jamu.Once you have extracted all the potent juice from the pulp","Give the Indonesian Jamu a taste and adjust accordingly.Store the Jamu in glass bottles in the refrigerator for upto a w"] },
