"nagori_puri_recipe_semolina_puri": { title: "Nagori Puri Recipe (Semolina Puri)", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["Water - as required","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1/2 cup Whole Wheat Flour","2 tablespoons Ghee","1 cup Sooji (Semolina/ Rava)","Sunflower Oil - as required"], product_ids: [2307,460,4140,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Nagori Puri Recipe, firstly sift wheat flour to a mixing bowl","Add rava, salt, cumin seeds and melted ghee to it.Mix and rub everything together to make it crumbly","Add water little by little and start kneading to make stiff dough.Divide the dough into small sized balls","Fry the puris one by one and serve hot","Serve Nagori Puri along with Gujarati Lasaniya Batata and Palak Raita for a weekend lunch with your family ✅"] },
