"atar_payesh_recipe_sitaphal_kheer": { title: "Atar Payesh Recipe (Sitaphal Kheer)", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["Sugar - to taste","100 ml Heavy whipping cream","2 liter Milk","1/4 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","4 Custard apple (Sitaphal)"], product_ids: [0,2307,2314,4141,2300], steps: ["To begin making the Atar Payesh recipe, break each of the custard apples gently into halves, scoop out the flesh with th","Carefully remove the seeds, lightly mash the custard apple pulp with a fork","(The custard apples I used were very sweet and just a tablespoon of sugar was enough for me)Switch off the flame, fold i","A hearty stir to ensure it is all mixed.Serve chilled","Serve Atar Payesh after a satisfying lunch of Cholar Dal, Bengali Luchi and Begun Bhaja on a weekday ✅"] },
