"tempura_chicken_wings_with_barbecue_sauce_recipe": { title: "Tempura Chicken Wings With Barbecue Sauce Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🥡 Indo-Chinese", all_ingredients: ["1 inch Ginger - chopped","4 tablespoons Corn flour","1/2 cup Whole Wheat Bread crumbs","2 cloves Garlic - chopped","1 teaspoon Chilli vinegar","8 Chicken Wings","1 Whole Egg","Salt and Pepper - to taste","2 tablespoon Barbeque sauce"], product_ids: [2307,973,4143,1842,4148,2300,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Tempura Chicken Wings With Barbecue Sauce Recipe we will first boil the chicken wings in a sauce pan","Boil the wings for about 20 minutes on medium flame until it's half done","This par boiling method will help the wings to absorb less oil once you fry them","Turn off the flame, strain the wings and pat dry them using a kitchen towel","Do the same for the rest and fry the wings until golden brown.Heat another sauce pan with oil on medium flame, add ginge","Add the barbecue sauce and chili vinegar and once it start to sizzle, toss in the fried tempura chicken wings and coat t","Serve the Tempura Chicken Wings With Barbecue Sauce along with some fresh salad and a cocktail by the side ✅"] },
"moong_dal_tikki_recipe": { title: "Moong Dal Tikki Recipe", serves: "3", time: "155 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1/4 Cup Paneer (Homemade Cottage Cheese) - grated","1/2 tablespoon Amchur (Dry Mango Powder)","6 Green Chillies","1 Cup Yellow Moong Dal (Split)","Salt - to taste","1/2 Tablespoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","1 Onion - finely chopped","4 tablespoons Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","3 tablespoons Green Bell Pepper (Capsicum) - finely chopped","1/2 tablespoon Chaat Masala Powder","1 Inch Ginger","1-1/2 tablespoons Corn flour"], product_ids: [1,930,2307,2308,973,1840,4145,1842], steps: ["To begin making Moong Dal Tikki Recipe, soak moong dal for a couple of hours.Boil some water in a saucepan and add moong","Boil moong dal for about five minutes on medium heat.Drain water and wash dal with cold water","This avoids the moong dal getting cooked any further","Keep it aside.Take a grinder and add dal, green chillies, coriander and ginger","Grind together to a coarse paste.Take a bowl, add grinded dal mixture, chopped onion, grated paneer, mashed peas, and mi","Make flat round tikkies.Heat oil in a non stick shallow fry pan, shallow fry them till golden on one side","Flip and shallow fry on the otherServe Moong Dal Tikki Recipe along with Green Chutney and Khajur Imli Chutney and a cup"] },
"mughlai_zafrani_murg_recipe": { title: "Mughlai Zafrani Murg Recipe", serves: "3", time: "35 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","3 tablespoons Fresh cream","Salt - to taste","1/4 teaspoon Saffron strands","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","1 teaspoon Coriander Powder (Dhania)","500 grams Chicken - chopped to bite size","1/4 teaspoon Garam masala powder - to spinkle","2 teaspoons Lemon juice","100 grams Curd (Dahi / Yogurt)","1 tablespoon Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - chopped"], product_ids: [930,2307,2314,4141,973,4142,48,2300], steps: ["Also add the soaked saffron with its water and give a mix","Garnish with coriander, sprinkle the garam masala and serve.Serve Mughlai Zafrani Murg Recipe with Saffron Pilaf Recipe "] },
"mixed_vegetables_oats_idli_recipe": { title: "Mixed Vegetables Oats Idli Recipe", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Lemon juice","1 teaspoon White Urad Dal (Split)","1 Carrot (Gajjar) - finely chopped","1/2 teaspoon Mustard seeds","50 grams Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","1 tablespoon Raw Peanuts (Moongphali)","Salt - to taste","8 Curry leaves","1/3 teaspoon Asafoetida (hing)","1 inch Ginger - grated","1/2 cup Curd (Dahi / Yogurt) - whisked","1/3 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera) - roasted"], product_ids: [930,2307,2308,2314,460,973,4142,48], steps: ["To begin making the Mixed Vegetable Oats Idli, first of all heat a pan and dry roast the oats and semolina separately.No","Now take a big bowl add the whisked yogurt in it, then add semolina and oats powder in it.Now add all chopped vegetables","Mix well.Now heat the oil in a pan and add mustard seeds","When the seeds crackle, add the urad dal, cumin seeds, curry leaves, peanuts, onion and asafoetida in it and saute on a ","Now cover this mixture and set aside for 15 to 30 minutes","Meanwhile grease the idli moulds with minimal oil and boil the water in a steamer.After 15 to 30 minutes add baking soda","Now put a 1 table spoon idli batter into each of the greased idli mould and steam in a steamer for about 13 to 15 minute","Serve hot.Serve Mixed Vegetables Oats Idli along with Keerai Sambar and Mysore Chutney for a healthy and filling breakfa"] },
