"cucumber_cucumber_fry_recipe_tindora_fry": { title: "Cucumber / Cucumber Fry Recipe - Tindora Fry", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon White Urad Dal (Split)","500 grams Tindora (Dondakaya/ Kovakkai) - (dondakkai)","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Mustard seeds","1/4 cup Fresh coconut - grated","1 sprig Curry leaves - finely chopped","1 pinch Asafoetida (hing)"], product_ids: [2307,2308,9,503,920,2300,2302], steps: ["Heat a teaspoon of oil in a heavy bottomed pan on medium heat","Add the mustard seeds and the halved urad dal","Allow them to crackle and roast the urad dal until it is crisp and golden","Once the dal is roasted, sprinkle the asafoetida, add the curry leaves and the steamed Kovakkai","Stir well to combine the Kovakkai Poriyal","Check the salt and adjust to suit your taste ✅"] },
"egg_roast_masala_dosa_recipe_with_moong_dal_dosa_b": { title: "Egg Roast Masala Dosa Recipe - With Moong Dal Dosa Batter", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🫘 Dal", all_ingredients: ["1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","6 Boiled egg","1/2 teaspoon Mustard seeds","2 sprig Curry leaves","Salt - to taste","1 inch Ginger - finely chopped","1 teaspoon Garam masala powder","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","2 Green Chillies - slit","6 cloves Garlic - finely chopped","2 teaspoon Coriander Powder (Dhania)","6 Tomatoes - finely chopped"], product_ids: [545,930,929,2307,2308,9,973,4148], steps: ["To begin making Egg Roast Masala Dosa - With Moong Dal Dosa Batter is first make the Moong Dal dosa batter","For this soak the dal and methi seeds together  in water along and the rice in another bowl for at least three hours.Onc","Add salt to it and let it ferment for 8 hours","The day you are ready to make the dosa, we will make the egg roast masala for the stuffing.For the egg roast masala, fir","Follow Boiled Eggs Recipe","Once boiled, slice the eggs, sprinkle some red chilli powder and salt over the eggs and keep aside.Next make the Egg Roa","Saute well and cook on medium flame till you get a nice mushy masala","Check the salt and spices and adjust according to taste.Once done, turn the heat off and keep the masala aside ✅"] },
