"kerala_tomato_fry_recipe_kerala_tomato_fry_recipe": { title: "Kerala Tomato Fry Recipe - Kerala Tomato Fry Recipe", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon rye","oil - as per use","1 tablespoon ginger garlic paste","1/2 tablespoon Kashmiri red chilli powder","5 curry leaves","2 tablespoons green coriander - finely chopped","3 dry red chillies - broken","salt - as per taste","4 tomatoes - chopped","1/2 tablespoon turmeric powder","2 green chillies - chopped","2 onions - finely chopped"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,973,920,476,2301,2302], steps: ["To make Kerala Tomato Fry, first heat the oil in a pan","Add mustard seeds and dry red chilies","When the mustard starts to crackle, add curry leaves, green chilies and onions","After 1 minute add ginger garlic paste","Cook onion until it becomes soft and brown","After that add Kashmiri red chilli powder and turmeric powder","Mix well and add chopped tomatoes","Let it cook for 5 to 7 minutes ✅"] },
