"chettinad_vegetable_biryani_recipe": { title: "Chettinad Vegetable Biryani Recipe", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🍚 Rice", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","1 Bay leaf (tej patta) - roughly torn","1 tablespoon Ghee","1/4 cup Cashew nuts - broken","2 Tomatoes - roughly chopped","12 Pearl onions (Sambar Onions) - finely chopped","1 teaspoon Whole Black Peppercorns","Salt - to taste","2 Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds","1 cup Rice","2 Stone flower - small","1 inch Ginger - finely chopped"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,2308,2314,460,13,973], steps: ["To begin making the Chettinad Vegetable Biryani Recipe, get all the ingredients ready and keep them aside.The first step","In to a pan, add the cloves, cardamom, pepper, fennel seeds, cinnamon, star anise and stone flower","Roast for about a minute until you get a roasted aroma.Once roasted, grind to make a fine powder of the spices","This will be our Biryani Masala.The next step is to make the Chettinad Veg Biryani","Heat ghee or oil into the pressure cooker over medium heat.Add the onion, ginger, garlic and saute until the onions soft","Once the onions are softened, add the tomatoes, and cook until the tomatoes soften.Finally add the vegetables, the Birya","Stir in the mint leaves and salt.Add 2 cups water and pressure cook the biryani for 2 whistles","After 2 whistles, turn the heat to low and simmer for 3 minutes and turn off the heat ✅"] },
"asian_style_rice_noodle_salad_recipe_with_vegetabl": { title: "Asian Style Rice Noodle Salad Recipe With Vegetables Recipe", serves: "3", time: "35 min", category: "🥗 Salad", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Lemon juice","200 grams Rice Noodles (Flat) - or thin","1 tablespoon Soy sauce","4 sprig Thai basil leaves - roughly torn","1 inch Ginger - grated","1 tablespoon Honey","2 cloves Garlic - finely chopped","1/2 cup Green peas (Matar)","1 teaspoon Red Chilli sauce","12 Green beans (French Beans) - cut into 1 inch pieces","1 tablespoon Sesame (Gingelly) Oil","1 Broccoli - cut into florets"], product_ids: [2307,2311,2314,460,973,48,1843,2300], steps: ["To begin making the Asian Style Rice Noodle Salad Recipe With Vegetables, cut the vegetables according to instructions a","Once done, turn off the heat, drain the water and wash the noodles in water to prevent further cooking.Steam the broccol","Keep the vegetables firm as it is a salad, you would like it to have a crunch.The next step is to make the dressing","Toss all the ingredients for the dressing in a mixing bowl and whisk it with a fork.In a large mixing bowl, add the cook","Toss all the ingredients well until well combined","Check the salt and spices and adjust to suit your taste.Serve the Asian Style Rice Noodle Salad along with Cream Of Cele"] },
"banarasi_chuda_pea_chuda_pea_recipe": { title: "Banarasi Chuda Pea / Chuda Pea Recipe", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["1 Green Chilli - finely chopped","1/4 teaspoon Black pepper powder","1 teaspoon Garam masala powder","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1 inch Ginger - grated","1 teaspoon Lemon juice","3/4 cup Green peas (Matar) - shelled","1/2 cup Milk","1/2 cup Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","2 teaspoon Ghee - or clarified butter","1/2 cup Fresh cream"], product_ids: [2304,4609,930,2307,4140,4141,973,48], steps: ["To begin with Banarasi Chooda Matar, wash the poha in the running tap water and soak it in the mix of cream and milk for","Now add the cumin seeds and let it crackle","Add finely chopped green chilli & ginger and saute for a while, add the washed shelled green peas","Toss the peas and now add the garam masala and black pepper powder","Serve Banarasi Chooda Matar/Chura Matar with hot masala chai for a royal breakfast ✅"] },
"kashmiri_saag_recipe_kashmiri_style_spinach_palak": { title: "Kashmiri Saag Recipe - Kashmiri Style Spinach / Palak", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["3 Kashmiri dry red chilli","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1 teaspoon Fennel Powder","1 Black cardamom (Badi Elaichi)","10 cloves Garlic","3 cups Spinach Leaves (Palak)","1 tablespoon Mustard oil","1 pinch Asafoetida (hing)"], product_ids: [2307,973,923,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin, making the Kashmiri Saag Recipe wash and clean the spinach leaves well","Finely chop them and set aside","In a skillet, heat mustard oil until smoking point on medium high flame","Once it begins to smoke, turn off the flame","Now add the cumin seeds, asafoetida, cardamom, red chillies, garlic and saute for a few minutes, until the garlic begins","Finally add the washed and cut spinach leaves, sprinkle salt and continue to cook on medium-high heat until the spinach ","Add the fennel powder and give Kashmiri Saag a good mix","Turn off the flame, check the salt and spices and adjust to suit your taste ✅"] },
