"raw_banana_tikkis_recipe": { title: "Raw Banana Tikkis Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Coriander Powder (Dhania)","6 Whole cashews","4 Raw Banana","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","2 Green Chillies - finely chopped","1 Onion - finely chopped","1/4 teaspoon Clove powder (Laung)","2 tablespoons Lemon juice","2 tablespoons Gram flour (besan)","2 tablespoons Ghee","1/4 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","5 Dates"], product_ids: [1,930,2307,2308,2314,4140,973,48], steps: ["To begin making the Raw Banana Tikkis, first remove the seeds from the dates and finely chop them","Next, add finely chopped the cashew nuts, ginger and green chillies and dates in a bowl along with some salt and keep as","Place the raw bananas in a pot of boiling water for 15 minutes","After 15 minutes, cool the bananas completely, peel the skin and grate the bananas into a plate and keep aside","Place a pan on low heat and add a teaspoon of ghee","Once the ghee is warm, add cumin seeds","Once the cumin seeds crackle, add finely chopped green chillies, ginger and onions and saute until the onions are browne","Once the onions are browned, add the grated banana, salt, red chilli powder, dry mango powder, lemon juice, gram flour ("] },
