"kashmiri_style_modur_pulao_recipe_kashmiri_sweet_p": { title: "Kashmiri Style Modur Pulao Recipe - Kashmiri Sweet Pulao", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["6 Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds","1 cup Basmati rice","Salt - as required","1 teaspoon tablespoon Dates - chopped","1 teaspoon teaspoon Raisins","3 Bay leaves (tej patta)","1 inch Cinnamon Stick (Dalchini)","1/4 teaspoon Whole Black Peppercorns","1 teaspoon teaspoon Cashew nuts - chopped","6 tablespoons Ghee","1 cup Sugar","1/4 teaspoon Saffron strands"], product_ids: [2307,2308,8,2314,4140,1842,2300,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Modur Pulao Recipe, wash rice thoroughly with water and soak for half an hour","Drain the water and set aside.In a small bowl, soak saffron with a tablespoon of water.In a small saucepan, add 2 cups o","Add rice and cook for about 5 to 10 minutes","Ensure that the rice is only cooked 3/4th","Do not cook for long time.Drain water from the rice and set aside.In a non-stick kadai heat ghee over medium flame","Once the ghee is hot, lower the flame and add cloves, bay leaves, cinnamon stick, cardamom, and Peppercorns.Cook them un","It should be in thick syrup consistency","Add the half cooked rice and give it a stir.Now add chopped dates, raisins, almonds and cashews to the rice ✅"] },
