"baba_ganoush_recipe_roasted_eggplant_middle_easter": { title: "Baba Ganoush Recipe (Roasted Eggplant Middle Eastern Dip)", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1 Brinjal (Baingan / Eggplant)","2 tablespoons Tahini","Salt and Pepper - to taste","Red Chilli powder - to taste","Pita chips - for dipping","3 sprig Parsley leaves - finely chopped","Extra Virgin Olive Oil","1 Lemon juice","3 cloves Garlic - finely chopped"], product_ids: [2307,973,4143,48,4148,469,924,2301], steps: ["There are two ways to roast the eggplants for the Baba Ganoush RecipeOVEN METHODFor the oven method: Preheat the oven to","Prick the eggplants all over with a fork, this keeps the eggplant from exploding in the oven","Place on a baking sheet and roast until softened and the skin is crusty about 20 to 30 minutes","Remove from the oven and allow to cool.STOVE TOP METHOD (shown in the video)Place the eggplant over the flame","Using a pair of tongs, turn every 5 minutes or so, until the entire surface of eggplant is charred and crispy, about 10 ","When you prick with a knife it will go in smoothly and would feel cooked","Don't worry if the eggplant deflates a little","Remove from the burner and place on a plate to cool.Once the eggplant is cool enough to touch with your hands, carefully"] },
