"mix_vegetable_risotto_recipe": { title: "Mix Vegetable Risotto Recipe", serves: "3", time: "35 min", category: "🍝 Pasta", all_ingredients: ["Parmesan cheese - shavings as required","1 tablespoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","1/2 teaspoon Whole Black Peppercorns - crushed","3 cups Vegetable stock - (or as required)","2 tablespoon Butter","1 cup Mixed vegetables - chopped and blanched (you can use peas","1 Onion - finely chopped","Fresh Herbs - as required for garnish (you can basil","3 cloves Garlic - minced","1 cup Arborio rice","3 tablespoon Ricotta Cheese"], product_ids: [2303,2307,4144,4145,1842,2300,503,476], steps: ["To begin making the mix vegetable Risotto, first warm the stock.Heat oil in a pan","Add garlic and onion","Sauté till the onion just softens, but does not brown.Add the rice and stir","Sauté for a minute till the rice starts getting translucent.Add a ladleful of the warm stock","Stir and cook till the stock almost evaporates.Add another ladleful of stock","Stir and cook again","Repeat till the rice is just cooked, till it still has a bite to it.Add the vegetables and stir","Take it off the heat ✅"] },
"apple_jalebi_recipe": { title: "Apple Jalebi Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["2 Apples - (adjust)","1 cup All Purpose Flour (Maida)","300 grams Sugar","1 tablespoon All Purpose Flour (Maida)","1 teaspoon Cinnamon Powder (Dalchini)","Saffron strands - a few","1 cup Water","Rose water - few drops","2 tablespoons Curd (Dahi / Yogurt)","Sunflower Oil - to deep fry","Pistachios - to garnish","Canned Cherries - to garnsh"], product_ids: [0,2307,2308,2314,4142,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Apple Jalebi Recipe, in a mixing bowl, add all purpose flour, yogurt and add some water and mix well","Let it rest for 5 to 6 hours.Make sugar syrup by adding sugar, water, saffron, rose water and green cardamom in a saucep","Make it little thick (2 strings consistency).Take a plate and add 1 tablespoon all purpose flour, 1 tablespoon cinnamon ","Coat the apple slices in the flour and cinnamon powder.Next dip the apple slices in the batter and deep fry in the hot o","Do not dip the fried apples in the sugar syrup for too long,otherwise it would turn soggy ✅"] },
"jaisalmer_kala_chana_kadhi_recipe_rajasthani_chick": { title: "Jaisalmer Kala Chana Kadhi Recipe - Rajasthani Chick Curry", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🫘 Dal", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Curd (Dahi / Yogurt)","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1/2 cup Kala Chana (Brown Chickpeas) - soaked overnight in water","Salt - to taste","1/4 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1 teaspoon Coriander Powder (Dhania)","1/2 teaspoon Garam masala powder","1/4 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","1 Green Chilli - chopped","2 tablespoons Gram flour (besan)","1 teaspoons Ghee"], product_ids: [930,2307,2308,2314,4140,973,4142,503], steps: ["To begin making the Jaisalmer Kala Chana Kadhi, pressure cook the soaked chickpeas with water and salt for at least 5 to","It will take about 20 minutes to cook the Kala chana","Keep this aside.We will first start by combining all the main ingredients in a large saucepan","Continue to whisk it until you notice it has begun to thicken and the Kadhi is smooth.Once it is beginning to become smo","You can optionally mash a few kala chana and add into the Jaisalmer Kala Chana Kadhi.Simmer for a good 10 minutes","The more you simmer, the tastier the kadhi gets.To temper the Jaisalmer Kala Chana Kadhi, heat a small tempering pan wit","Serve the Jaisalmeri Kala Chana Kadhi Recipe along hot steamed rice and Instant Raw Mango Pickle for a wholesome weeknig"] },
