"paal_kozhukattai_recipe_with_bananas_with_vegan_op": { title: "Paal Kozhukattai Recipe With Bananas - With Vegan Option", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Ripe Bananas - sliced for garnish","1 teaspoon Sesame (Gingelly) Oil","1/4 teaspoon Salt","1 cup Rice flour","1-1 1/2 cups Water","3 cups Milk - full fat milk or coconut milk for vegans","1/2 cup Coconut milk - thick","1 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","1 cup Coconut milk - thin","3/4 cup Sugar - or Jaggery"], product_ids: [2307,9,2314,4141,15,27,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Paal Kozhukattai Recipe With Bananas, let us start with preparing the rice dumplings","In a small pot, bring 2 1/2 cups of water to boil","Once the water starts boiling, add sesame oil and turn off the heat.In a bowl, add rice flour and salt","Combine them together","Add water slowly little by little and mix continuously to prepare the dough","Knead the dough together to prepare a soft dough.Once the dough comes together, grease your palm with oil and roll small","I rolled the dough into small coin shaped ones as I preferred a different shape than the usual round ones","Ensure the dough is covered with damp cloth all the time to prevent it from losing its moisture ✅"] },
