"goan_raw_banana_sabzi_recipe": { title: "Goan Raw Banana Sabzi Recipe", serves: "3", time: "20 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["3 Raw Banana - chopped to cubes","1 Dry Red Chilli","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","2 teaspoons Sunflower Oil","4 tablespoons Fresh coconut - grated","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1 teaspoon Mustard seeds","1 Onion - finely chopped","1 sprig Curry leaves"], product_ids: [2307,9,973,2300,920,27,476,2301], steps: ["Add the onions and saute until it turns translucent.Drain the plantains and add it to the pan","Saute.Add turmeric powder, salt, mix well and let the plantains cook with the lid closed for 5 minutes ✅"] },
"garlic_shrimp_linguine_pasta_recipe": { title: "Garlic Shrimp Linguine Pasta Recipe", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🍝 Pasta", all_ingredients: ["1/2 teaspoon Red Chilli flakes","4 cloves Garlic - minced","Salt - to taste","4 tablespoon Butter (unsalted)","1/2 teaspoon Dried oregano","Black pepper powder - to taste","1/4 cup Parmesan cheese - freshly grated","200 grams Shrimps - peeled and deveined","2 cups Linguine Pasta"], product_ids: [2307,973,4144,4145,2300,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Garlic Shrimp Linguine Pasta recipe, Take a large pot of boiling salted water, cook pasta according ","Wash it under cold water to stop further cooking, drizzle some olive oil over it and coat the pasta well and keep aside","Season shrimp with salt and pepper, to taste; set aside.Melt 2 tablespoons butter in a large skillet over medium high he","Add garlic, oregano, and red pepper flakes, and cook, stirring frequently, until fragrant, about 1-2 minutes","Add shrimp and cook, stirring occasionally, until pink, about 2-3 minutes; set aside.Melt remaining butter in another sk","Stir in linguine and Parmesan for about 2 minutes.After 2 minutes, add in the shrimp and mix everything","Serve hot.Serve Garlic Shrimp Linguine Pasta with Garlic Bread With Herb Butter Recipe, and Cream Of Mushroom & Spring O"] },
