"sweet_lime_soda_recipe_sweet_lime_soda": { title: "Sweet Lime Soda Recipe (Sweet Lime Soda)", serves: "3", time: "15 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["4 tablespoons sugar","black salt or rock salt - as per taste","pepper powder - a pinch","1 cup soda","peppermint - as per use","1 teaspoon cumin powder","1 cup water","ice - According to use","1/4 cup lime juice"], product_ids: [2307,2314,48,946,2300,2302], steps: ["To make sweet lime soda, mix lemon juice, water, sugar, cumin powder, black salt, black pepper powder in a bowl and mix ","Syrup is ready","Add ice chunks, mint leaves, lemon pieces in glass, add syrup, then add soda and serve immediately","Suggestion - Use sugar as per your taste","You can also use salt or sedha salt in place of black salt","Serve white lime soda with mathri and biscuits in the evening ✅"] },
