"one_pot_tex_mex_penne_pasta_recipe": { title: "One Pot Tex-Mex Penne Pasta Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍝 Pasta", all_ingredients: ["1 Onion - sliced","Salt - as required","1 teaspoon Garlic - crushed","1 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","1 teaspoon Garlic powder","2 cups Penne pasta","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","Milk - as required","1 tablespoon Parsley leaves - finely chopped","1/4 cup Parmesan cheese - grated","Extra Virgin Olive Oil - as required","1 Green Bell Pepper (Capsicum) - sliced"], product_ids: [2307,924,4141,973,1840,4145,2300,476], steps: ["To begin making the One Pot Tex-Mex Penne Pasta recipe, Heat olive oil in a heavy bottomed pan","After 2 to 3 minutes, turn the heat low and add the required milk.Mix well and stir continuously for about 2 minutes","After 2 minutes add the raw pasta and parmesan cheese and let it cook till the penne is cooked properly.Once it is done,","Serve One Pot Tex-Mex Penne Pasta along with Whole Wheat Oats and Pesto Bread Recipe or a Fresh Garden Salad Recipefor a"] },
"saffron_pistachio_firni_recipe": { title: "Saffron Pistachio Firni Recipe", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["2 tablespoons Badam (Almond) - blanched and slivered","2 tablespoons Pistachios - chopped","3/4 cup Sugar","Saffron strands - a few","1 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","1/4 cup Basmati rice - soaked for 30 minutes","700 ml Milk"], product_ids: [2314,2307,2300,4141], steps: ["To begin making Kesar Pista Phirni Recipe, wash the basmati rice and soak in water for 20 to 30 minutes.Once soaked drai","Place a saucepan over medium heat and add the milk","Add few saffron strands, cardamom powder, sugar","Stir well until sugar dissolves.Once done add the ground rice paste","Keep stirring to avoid lumps","Continue to stir and cook till the rice is cooked completely and has become thick.Once the rice is cooked and thickened ","Add the chopped pistachios and almonds and stir well","Transfer the Kesar Pista Phirni Recipe into serving dishes ✅"] },
