"labongo_latika_recipe": { title: "Labongo Latika Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["3 Cloves (Laung)","1 inch Cinnamon Stick (Dalchini)","10 Cloves (Laung)","1/2 kg Sugar","200 grams Khoya (Mawa)","1/2 liter Water","2 tablespoons Cashew nuts - chopped","Saffron strands - few","1/2 kg All Purpose Flour (Maida) - Ghee / Refined oil - for deep frying Baking soda- ½ tea spoon Cloves- 10/12","3 Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds","1 tablespoon Raisins","1/2 teaspoon Baking soda"], product_ids: [2307,2308,8,2314,4140,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Labongo Latika recipe, mix maida with baking soda, 2 tablespoons of ghee and sufficient water to mak","Divide it into small round balls just like the size of a lemon.Make a syrup with all the ingredients and boil till it re","To make the filling, grate khoya and mix with all the ingredients mentioned to make the filling","Mix it properly and keep aside","Roll the balls in the shape of pooris","Put some filling into the middle and then fold from all the sides","Prick a clove at the center.Meanwhile heat oil/ghee in a deep frying pan","Put the balls into the pan one by one and deep fry them  till they change their colour to golden brown ✅"] },
"moong_dal_ladoo_recipe": { title: "Moong Dal Ladoo Recipe", serves: "3", time: "20 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Caster Sugar","1 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","1/3 cup Ghee","Badam (Almond) - as required","1 cup Yellow Moong Dal (Split)","Whole cashews - as required","Pistachios - as required"], product_ids: [2307,2308,2314,4140,503,2300], steps: ["To begin making Moong Dal Ladoo Recipe, in a large kadai, dry roast the moong dal on low to medium heat for 10 minutes o","Turn off and cool the lentils to room temperature","You can use either sugar or caster sugar for this recipe","Grind the dal and sugar separately, in a blender into fine powders","(If you are using caster sugar, there is no need to dry grind.)Sift the dal and sugar powders separately and remove if a","Later add in the ground dal, sugar, cardamom powder and mix with a wooden spatula.Let the mixture heat up for a minute o","Allow the dal mix to soak up all the ghee","Once the mixture comes together turn off the heat.Transfer the mixture on to a plate and cool the mixture at room temper"] },
