"jackfruit_seed_modak_recipe": { title: "Jackfruit Seed Modak Recipe", serves: "3", time: "70 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Sesame (Gingelly) Oil","Ghee - as required","Thonnai (dried leaves) - as needed","1 cup Rice flour","1/2 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","Water - as needed","pinch Salt","1/3 cup Palm sugar - powdered","1 cup Jackfruit Seeds (Kathal)"], product_ids: [2307,2314,4140,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Jackfruit Seed Modak recipe, we will first prepare the jackfruit seed stuffing.Take a pressure cooke","Pressure cook for 4 whistles.Allow the pressure release naturally, drain the water and remove the outer thick white skin","The brown skin is fine","Allow it to cool completely.In a mixer grinder, add the cooked jackfruit seeds, powdered palm sugar and cardamom powder","Do not add water","Transfer into a bowl and divide them into 14 equal balls","You need to rub your palm with ghee before shaping them so that they will not stick on to your hands.The next step is to","Boil 2 cups of water, you may not need all of it ✅"] },
"whole_wheat_masala_papdi_recipe_kadak_puri_recipe": { title: "Whole Wheat Masala Papdi Recipe / Kadak Puri Recipe", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1/4 cup Ghee","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Ajwain (Carom seeds)","1 cup Whole Wheat Flour","1 teaspoon Whole Black Pepper Corns - coarsely pounded"], product_ids: [2307,4140,1842,2300,2302], steps: ["To begin making the homemade Papdi, we will first have to make the dough.Mix all the flour, ajwain, pepper, oil and salt","Add water a little at a time and knead the papdi dough until it becomes firm and smooth and firm","You can optionally at this stage sprinkle chaat masala on the top to make it chatpata","Allow it to cool and store the Papdi / kadak puri in an airtight container","Use the Papdi to make chaats like Mumbai Style Bhelpuri, Sev Papdi Chaat, and many more","You sure can innovate your topping, may be like a chilli-cheese, or chilli corn and cheese, etc ✅"] },
"vazaithandu_neer_mor_recipe_plantain_stem_buttermi": { title: "Vazaithandu Neer Mor Recipe - Plantain Stem Buttermilk", serves: "3", time: "15 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["Curry leaves - a few","Water - as required","Asafoetida (hing) - a generous pinch of hing powder","1/2 cup Curd (Dahi / Yogurt)","1 Plantain Stem - (small)","2 teaspoons Lemon juice"], product_ids: [2307,2314,4142,48,920,27,2300], steps: ["To begin making the Vazhaithandu Neer Mor recipe, peel the outer skin of plantain stem","This one comes off very easily.Chop the inner part of the stem coarsely and grind it in a mixer grinder with about 200 m","Filtering with the regular metallic strainers might not work out.Mix yogurt, hing, salt, lemon and curry leaves","Blend them nicely without any lumps in a blender.Refrigerate it for few minutes and your Vazhaithandu Neer Mor is ready "] },
"maharashtrian_aloo_bhujne_recipe_in_hindi": { title: "Maharashtrian Aloo Bhujne (Recipe In Hindi)", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon whole pepper","4 Potatoes - peeled and cut into round balls","5 tablespoons coriander seeds","2 tablespoons oil","1/2 teaspoon fenugreek seeds","asafetida - a pinch","1 green chili - chopped","1 teaspoon turmeric powder","1 tablespoon chickpea lentils","5 dry red chillies","1/2 small Spoon cumin seeds","1/2 teaspoon mustard"], product_ids: [929,930,2307,2308,973,2300,503,473], steps: ["To make Maharashtrian potato bhujana, first peel the potato and cut it round","Now put it in a pressure cooker with water as per use and cook till 1 city comes","Allow the pressure to drain and keep aside","Now put coriander seeds, wheat germ, gram dal, cumin, rye, fenugreek seeds, dry red chillies, asafoetida and turmeric po","Bake for 5 minutes","Let cool slightly and grind in a mixer grinder","Keep it aside","Now heat oil in a pan ✅"] },
