"soba_noodle_salad_recipe": { title: "Soba Noodle Salad Recipe", serves: "3", time: "15 min", category: "🥗 Salad", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Sesame (Gingelly) Oil","1/2 cup Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - chopped","1 tablespoon Soy sauce","1 tablespoon Sesame seeds (Til seeds) - (black and white)","1 tablespoon Sriracha sauce","1 inch Ginger - grated","Salt - to taste","1 tablespoon Honey","1 cup Carrots (Gajjar) - grated","Black pepper powder - to taste","1 tablespoons Basil leaves - chopped","1 tablespoon Rice Vinegar"], product_ids: [930,2307,2311,2314,973,48,1840,946], steps: ["To begin making the Soba Noodle Salad recipe, in a pot boil the soba noodles as per package instructions","Strain under cold water and keep aside.In a salad bowl, add the red cabbage, bell peppers, green onions, carrots, corian","The salad tastes better if you let it sit in the refrigerator for some time","Enjoy!Serve Soba Noodle Salad along with Chinese Vegetarian Fried Rice With Apples for a weekend night dinner ✅"] },
