"one_pot_chicken_fried_rice_recipe": { title: "One Pot Chicken Fried Rice Recipe", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🍚 Rice", all_ingredients: ["1 Green Chilli - finely chopped","1 Fresh Red Chilli - finely chopped","1 Carrot (Gajjar) - peeled and minced","10 Button mushrooms - quartered","1 tablespoon Soy sauce","4 sprig Spring Onion Greens - chopped","Salt - to taste","4 cloves Garlic - grated or minced","1 inch Ginger - grated","1/2 Red Bell pepper (Capsicum) - minced","1/2 cup Bean Sprouts","2 tablespoon Red Chilli sauce"], product_ids: [2307,2311,973,1840,465,1842,468,2300], steps: ["To begin making the One Pot Chicken Nasi Goreng Recipe, we will keep cooked rice ready","Either use the leftover rice or make fresh rice and cool it down completely.Heat a kadai with oil, add ginger and garlic","This will take about 10 more minutes.After the cabbage is done, add some mushroom and cook for another 10 minutes till i","Add in bean sprouts and cook the mixture","Cook for about 2 minutes.After 2 minutes, add cooked rice and stir fry them until it is evenly coated","At the end sprinkle some spring onions and set aside.Into a separate pan, heat some oil, add chicken pieces","Sprinkle some salt, soy sauce and stir fry until the chicken is done","This will take 5 to 6 minutes.Add the chicken pieces into fried rice, toss it over and serve hot.Serve the One Pot Chick"] },
"savory_carrot_olive_spinach_sandwich_spread_recipe": { title: "Savory Carrot Olive Spinach Sandwich Spread Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Chia Seeds","1 tablespoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","1/4 cup Spinach Leaves (Palak) - finely chopped","1/2 teaspoon Dried basil leaves","Salt - to taste","2 tablespoons Britannia Cream Cheese - softened","1/2 teaspoon Black pepper powder","1/2 cup Walnuts - finely chopped","2 Carrots (Gajjar) - peeled and grated","1 clove Garlic - finely chopped","2 tablespoons Pimiento-stuffed green olives - finely chopped"], product_ids: [2303,2307,4141,4145,468,923,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Savory Carrot Spinach Sandwich Spread Recipe wash, peel carrots and grate it in a bowl","Wash spinach in water to get rid of any dirt particles","Finely chop spinach leaves and transfer to the same bowl as carrot","Similarly fine chop olives, pecans and garlic clove and add to the bowl of chopped vegetables.Now add cream cheese, salt","Stir with the spoon, add olive oil to get the smooth spreading consistency","Adjust seasoning as per your taste","The Savory Carrot Spinach Spread is ready to be served as a spread on sandwiches, wraps or even as a dip for parties","The sandwiches made from Savory Carrot Spinach Spread also make great school lunch box additions for kids ✅"] },
"paneer_i_pizza_recipe": { title: "Paneer I Pizza Recipe", serves: "3", time: "90 min", category: "🍝 Pasta", all_ingredients: ["1 Onion - sliced","1/2 teaspoon Red Chilli flakes","1/4 cup Hung Curd (Greek Yogurt)","4 cloves Garlic","1 teaspoon Baking powder","Salt - to taste","Lukewarm Water - as needed","4 Blanched tomatoes","1/2 teaspoon Dry mix herbs","1/4 teaspoon Butter - melted","1/4 cup Milk - warm","100 grams Paneer (Homemade Cottage Cheese)"], product_ids: [545,2307,2314,4140,973,4141,4142,1840], steps: ["Rest the dough for at least 45 minutes in a dry and warm place.Once the dough is rested, divide them into 2 equal portio","Dust your working counter with flour, roll each portion into balls.Using a rolling pin or your hand, gently roll out the","Place the rolled out naan bread on the tava.You will start seeing bubbles on the naan as it cooks","When done on one side, flip and cook the other side.Repeat the same process for all the naans.The next step is to make t","Puree the blanched tomatoes along with the garlic cloves.Heat a pan with butter or oil and add the tomato puree.Add red ","Pizza sauce is ready.*Assembling the Naan Pizza:Line a baking tray with foil","Apply a coat of butter or oil on the foil using a brush .Assemble the naans on the baking tray.Grease the naan with butt","Spread the pizza sauce over each naan.Sprinkle cheese generously ✅"] },
