"mango_rice_recipe": { title: "Mango Rice Recipe", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["Salt - as required","1 teaspoon White Urad Dal (Split)","Sunflower Oil - as required","Water - as required","2 Dry Red Chilli","1-1 1/2 cups Mango (Ripe) - raw unripe","1 teaspoon Mustard seeds","1/2 cup Fresh coconut - grated","2 tablespoons Jaggery","1/4 cup Raw Peanuts (Moongphali)","pinch Asafoetida (hing)","1/4 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)"], product_ids: [1,2307,2308,9,2314,973,503,920], steps: ["To begin with the Mango Rice recipe, first soak the rice for 20 minute and have all other ingredients ready","After the soaking cook the rice in a pressure cooker  and then spread it in a plate and leave it aside.For the next step","Then add mustard seeds and channa dal as well as urad dal.Add 12 – 15 curry leaves and 1 or 2 dry red chillies and sauté","Now add a pinch of asafoetida and 1/4 teaspoon of turmeric powder.Now add the raw mango and coconut paste in the pan and","Add the rice which was cooked earlier and mix them well.Mango rice is ready to be served","The best way to serve mango rice is with spicy potato roast","You can also serve them with raita and pickle ✅"] },
