"sandah_guri_recipe_assamese_roasted_rice_flour_por": { title: "Sandah Guri Recipe (Assamese Roasted Rice Flour Porridge)", serves: "3", time: "165 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["2 tablespoons Raisins - roasted in ghee","3-1/2 tablespoons Jaggery - grated","2 cups Milk - boiled","1 cup Rice - soaked for 2 hours","2 teaspoons Ghee - (adjust)"], product_ids: [8,2314,4140,4141,2300,2301], steps: ["To prepare Sandah Guri Recipe (Assamese Roasted Rice Flour Porridge), wash and soak rice for a minimum of 2 hours","Drain water and spread the rice on a kitchen towel or clean cloth to soak the excess water.Change the kitchen towel and ","Do this a couple of times till the rice is nicely dry","(doing less of this will increase the time taken to roast","You can also dry it under sun)Heat a nonstick kadai/shallow frying pan and dry roast rice over medium heat but stirring ","Keep aside to cool.In a grinder jar, add the roasted and cooled rice to grind to a coarse flour","Collect the flour in an airtight jar and keep in a cool dry place for later use","Take 2-3 tablespoons of flour in a bowl and add milk or well whisked curd and stir well ✅"] },
