"sindhi_karela_bhaji_recipe": { title: "Sindhi Karela Bhaji Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1/2 tsp cardamom powder","2 bitter gourd - cut it round","1 tsp Kashmiri red chilli powder","2 tsp coriander powder","as per taste","2 green chillies - finely chopped","1/2 tsp turmeric powder","1 tsp pomegranate powder","5 cloves garlic - Finely chop","1 tsp cumin","coriander powder - finely chopped Take salt - 1 tbsp oil","2 tomatoes - finely chopped"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,973,4142,24,476,2301], steps: ["To make Sindhi Karela Bhaji recipe, first of all add 2 tablespoons water, salt and mix with bitter gourd in a pressure c","Close the cooker and cook till 2 cities come","Turn off the gas","Take out the pressure Keep the cooker under cold water, which will drain all its pressure","Open the cooker and take out the bitter gourd and keep it separately","Now heat oil in a pan","Add cumin seeds and let it splutter","After the cumin seeds crackle, add garlic, green chilies and cook for 30 seconds ✅"] },
