"paatolyo_recipe_goan_sweet_dish": { title: "Paatolyo Recipe (Goan Sweet Dish)", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1/4 cup Instant Oats (Oatmeal)","Salt - to taste","1/2 cup Fresh coconut - grated","1/2 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","2 Turmeric leaves - Long ones","3/4 cup Jaggery - adjustable","2 tablespoon Ragi Flour (Finger Millet/ Nagli)","1/4 cup Rice flour","1 pinch Salt","1/4 cup Jowar Flour (Sorghum)","1/4 cup Dry Fruits"], product_ids: [2307,9,2314,2300,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Paatolyo, first mix together the jaggery, grated coconut, cardamom powder, salt, ragi flour and oats","Keep aside to cool down.Meanwhile, wash and dry the turmeric leaves","Fold the other half of the leaf lightly over the filled half and seal the edges giving a little pressure","Place on the steamer plate and steam for 15 minutes","Serve with some homemade ghee.Serve Paatolyo as a dessert after your Goan meal of Goan Chana Ros, Tambdi Bhaji and Steam"] },
