"basil_pesto_bombs_recipe": { title: "Basil Pesto Bombs Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["1/2 Black pepper powder","400 grams Sweet Potato","Salt - to taste","1/3 cup Walnuts - pine nuts","1/2 Lemon juice","1/2 Dried oregano","2 teaspoons Red Chilli flakes","1/2 Chia Seeds","1/2 cup Extra Virgin Olive Oil","3 cloves Garlic","1/2 Apple cider vinegar","1 pinch Salt"], product_ids: [0,2303,2307,973,48,4145,473,2300], steps: ["It should not stick to your hands","If the dough is sticky add the remaining 1/4 cup oat flour and mix well.Now pinch a lemon sized dough, flatten it and sp","Repeat with the remaining dough mixture.Cook them on a paniyaram pan/mini dutch pancake pan by drizzling very little oil"] },
"maharashtrian_chavali_chi_usal_recipe_black_eyed_p": { title: "Maharashtrian Chavali Chi Usal Recipe - Black Eyed Peas Curry", serves: "3", time: "160 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Garam masala powder","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","4 tablespoon Fresh coconut","1 tablespoon Fennel seeds (Saunf)","1 inch Ginger - chopped","4 cloves Garlic","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","1 Onion - chopped","2 tablespoon Coriander (Dhania) Seeds","1 Tomato - chopped","1 cup Black Eyed Beans (Lobia) - soaked for 2 hours"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,9,973,2300,476], steps: ["To begin making the Maharashtrian Chavali Chi Usal soak the black eyed peas in water for 2 hours and keep it ready.Heat ","Saute for 1 minute","Add chopped onions and fry till the onions become light brown.Add ginger, garlic and coconut and saute for 2 more minute","Grind the sautéed ingredients to a smooth paste.Heat a pressure cooker with oil, saute the onions till it is translucent","Add the ground paste along with garam masala powder, turmeric powder, and red chilli powder and saute them well till the","Add the chopped onions and black eyed peas and saute for 2 more minutes.Check for salt add 2 cups of water and pressure ","Once done allow the pressure to release by itself","Add chopped coriander leaves as garnish.Serve the Maharashtrian Chavali Chi Usal Recipe can be had with steamed rice, Ko"] },
"goan_style_empada_de_camarao_recipe_prawn_pie": { title: "Goan Style Empada De Camarao Recipe (Prawn Pie)", serves: "3", time: "70 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["18 grams Tamarind Paste","1 tablespoon Sugar","1 inch Cinnamon Stick (Dalchini)","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","1/2 cup Vivatta Maida","10 Dry Red Chillies","1 Onion - chopped","300 grams Prawns - deveined and chopped small","1/2 teaspoon Salt","3 cloves Garlic","1 cup Whole Wheat Flour","3 to 4 tablespoons Chilled water"], product_ids: [545,2307,2308,2311,2314,973,4144,1842], steps: ["To begin making the Goan Style Empada De Camarao Recipe, we will make the pie crust first","Get all the ingredients ready and get your butter cut into small pea size pieces.The next step is to make the dough for ","In a large mixing bowl, combine the flour, salt, and sugar","Add the butter into the flour mixture.Work the butter into the flour with your fingers until the mixture resembles a coa","When you hold the flour together, it should hold tight and when you let it loose, it will fall apart.Sprinkle ice water ","Add in tomatoes and saute till it becomes mushy and soft.Add your ground recheado masala and keep sautéing until the raw","Add chopped prawns at the end, sprinkle with little salt and cook until the prawns curl up and switch off the flame imme","Set aside the filling to cool, pre heat the oven to 180 degree Celsius to 10 minutes and leave it aside ✅"] },
