"homemade_mango_ice_cream_recipe": { title: "Homemade Mango Ice-Cream Recipe", serves: "3", time: "920 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Mango (Ripe) - chopped","400 ml Fresh cream - Amul","3/4 cup Sugar","1 cup Mango Pulp (Puree)"], product_ids: [1,2314,4141], steps: ["To begin making the Homemade Mango Ice-Cream Recipe,  Into a blender add cream, mango puree and sugar","Blend until  well combined, about 2 minutes","Keep aside.Now we will set up the Kitchenif Ice Cream Maker.Place the ice cream bowl which has been kept in the freezer ","Attach the paddle and start the ice cream maker .Pour the mango ice cream mixture through the opening into the ice cream","You will see that slowly, the ice cream will start to turn thick and creamy.After 20 minutes add the chopped mangoes int","Turn off the ice cream maker.Once done, spoon the churned Mango Ice Cream into a container with an air tight lid (You ca","Cover and freeze the mango ice cream for 4 to 5 hours ✅"] },
