"baked_vegetable_salad_recipe": { title: "Baked Vegetable Salad Recipe", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🥗 Salad", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","6 Baby corn - cut into half","Salt - to taste","Cherry tomatoes - as required","1 Onion - chopped","1 Carrot (Gajjar) - chopped","4 cloves Garlic - crushed well","Black pepper powder - to taste","1/2 cup Green zucchini","Parsley leaves - chopped as required","2 tablespoons Mustard sauce","1 teaspoon Honey"], product_ids: [545,3,2307,924,2314,1840,1842,468], steps: ["To begin making the Baked Vegetable Salad recipe, preheat the oven at 180 degrees","Make sure you prep up all the ingredients before you start the oven.In a mixing bowl, add roughly chopped vegetables wit","Add this dressing to the baked vegetables and mix them well.Add parsley and toss everything together","Baked vegetable salad is ready to serve.Serve Baked Vegetable Salad along with Roasted Tomato and Pumpkin Soup for a hea"] },
"mustard_egg_curry_recipe": { title: "Mustard Egg Curry Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["Salt - to taste","1-1/2 tablespoon Mustard seeds - + 1 teaspoon extra","4 Green Chillies","1 Onion","1/4 cup Fresh coconut - grated","4 Whole Eggs - boiled","200 grams Coconut milk","Sugar - a pinch","1 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1 teaspoon Panch Phoran Masala","Sunflower Oil - as required"], product_ids: [2307,9,2314,4141,973,4148,2300,476], steps: ["To begin making the Mustard Egg Curry recipe, grind together 1-1/2 tablespoon mustard seeds, green chillies, grated coco","Once done, keep it aside.Heat oil in a pan","Add 1 teaspoon mustard seeds","As it crackles, add curry leaves and onions to it","Saute it till the onions soften","Once the onions are soft and translucent, add the ground masala to this and add 1/4 cup water and let it come to a boil.","To this add cut pieces of egg and boil it till it reaches a creamy gravy consistency.Serve Mustard Egg Curry along with "] },
"andhra_style_chama_dumpa_pulusu_recipe_arbi_with_s": { title: "Andhra Style Chama Dumpa Pulusu Recipe - Arbi With Sesame Tamarind Sau", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["2 teaspoons Tamarind Paste","1/2 teaspoon Mustard seeds","3 tablespoons Sesame seeds (Til seeds)","Salt - to taste","4 Green Chillies - slit","250 grams Colocasia root (Arbi)","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - Few sprigs","1/2 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1/4 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","Sunflower Oil - as required","Curry leaves - few"], product_ids: [930,2307,2311,973,920,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["Once cooled down, grind into powder.In a deep pan add the oil, once it's hot add the mustard, cumin seeds and allow them","Saute for few seconds.Now add the arbi pieces and fry for couple of minutes.Later add in the tamarind extract and salt","Give it a good stir and simmer for couple of minutes.Now add the sesame powder and cook for couple more minutes.Lastly s","Serve Arbi With Sesame Tamarind Sauce along with Phulkas and Kachumber Salad for a weekday lunch or dinner ✅"] },
"beans_on_toast_recipe": { title: "Beans On Toast Recipe", serves: "3", time: "130 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["3 tablespoon Extra Virgin Olive Oil","1 teaspoon Brown Sugar (Demerara Sugar) - (reduce if you prefer less sweetened beans)","1 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - for garnish","Salt - to taste","1-1/2 tablespoon Cayenne Pepper - or red chilli powder","2 Onions - chopped","4 slices Whole Wheat Brown Bread","2 to 3 cups Water","1 cup Dry beans","1/2 cup Homemade tomato puree","4 cloves Garlic - chopped"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,2314,973,4143,2300,476], steps: ["Add 2 cups of water and bring a boil on the high flame","After a boil, reduce the heat to medium","Cook the beans with lid on for about 45 minutes to 60 minutes","Keep stirring at regular intervals and keep adding water if you see the pan turning dry.Once beans are fully cooked, add","Turn off the flame and let the beans settle for some time.The next step is to bake the beans","Transfer the beans to a baking dish and cover it with a lid or with a aluminium foil.Bake the Beans on Toast at 180 degr","Check if it is baked properly, if not bake it for some more time until it's fully done.Take the baked beans out from the","Sprinkle some fresh coriander leaves or parsley for that beautiful hint of freshness in your bite.Serve Beans on Toast w"] },
"ragi_finger_millet_chocolate_brownie_recipe": { title: "Ragi (Finger Millet) Chocolate Brownie Recipe", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1/2 cup Ragi Flour (Finger Millet/ Nagli) - (ragi huri hittu is best to use)","1 Slivered Almonds (Badam) - or chopped walnuts to taste","1/2 teaspoon Baking powder","1 cup Brown Sugar (Demerara Sugar)","1/2 cup Whole Wheat Flour - or maida","1 teaspoon Vanilla Extract","1/4 teaspoon Salt","200 grams Butter (unsalted) - softened","2 tablespoons Milk","2 Whole Eggs","3/4 cup Cocoa Powder"], product_ids: [2314,4141,4144,4148,2300,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Ragi (Finger Millet) Chocolate Brownie Recipe, preheat oven to 180 C.Take a sauce pan and melt butte","Wait till it melts, but ensure it doesn't boil or bubble","Add sieved cocoa to the butter","Stir it into a nice, gooey consistency","Add vanilla essence and take it off the heat.Add the brown sugar and stir well till the sugar has slightly melted.Sieve ","Combine well.Whisk the eggs well using a hand mixer and add it to the mixture","Stir in almonds or walnuts and mix well","Add a couple of tablespoons of milk for smoother texture and consistency ✅"] },
"spinach_and_coriander_dosa_recipe": { title: "Spinach And Coriander Dosa Recipe", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["1 cup White Urad Dal (Whole) - soaked overnight","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - few sprigs","Sunflower Oil - for cooking","100 grams Spinach Leaves (Palak) - finely chopped","3 cups Rice - (raw rice)","1 teaspoon Methi Seeds (Fenugreek Seeds) - soaked overnight","1 teaspoon Salt"], product_ids: [929,930,2307,2308,503,923,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Spinach And Coriander Dosa Recipe, soak the rice in water, such that the all the rice is completely ","Let it soak for about 6 hours.Soak the urad dal and fenugreek in water such that all of the dal is completely immersed i","Let it soak for about 6 hours.Once soaked first grind the urad dal into a smooth batter","While grinding add just enough water to make it into a very smooth batter","The batter will look fluffy","Pour this batter into a large container.Grind the rice into an almost smooth batter, adding just the required amount of ","Grease the tawa with little oil.Take a scoop of batter and drop in the center of the tawa","Spread it evenly in outward circular motion.Add few drops of oil from the sides and in the center as well ✅"] },
