"tofu_chocolate_mousse_recipe": { title: "Tofu Chocolate Mousse Recipe", serves: "3", time: "10 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["Salt - a pinch","340 grams Tofu - drained (Firm Silken)","1/4 cup Coconut Oil - melted","1/2 teaspoons Vanilla Extract","1/2 cup Almond Milk (Badam Milk)","1/3 cup Maple syrup - or honey","3/4 cup Cocoa Powder"], product_ids: [9,2314,4141,4152,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Tofu Chocolate Mousse recipe, firstly add silken tofu, cocoa powder, maple syrup, salt, Vanilla extr","Blend the mixture until smooth","Serve Tofu Chocolate Mousse as a dessert after your simple meal of Cheese Garlic Bread Recipe, and Cheesy Baked Spaghett"] },
"pumpkin_wade_sweet_pumpkin_pooris_recipe": { title: "Pumpkin Wade (Sweet Pumpkin Pooris) Recipe", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["Sunflower Oil - for deep frying","Salt - to taste","2 teaspoon Sesame seeds (Til seeds)","1/2 cup Jaggery - grated","1 pinch Cooking soda","3 cups Whole Wheat Flour","4 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","2 cups Kaddu (Parangikai/ Pumpkin) - peeled and finely chopped","2 tablespoon Sunflower Oil"], product_ids: [2307,2314,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin with Pumpkin Wade, pressure cook the pumpkin by adding sufficient water for 3 whistles","Switch off the gas and let it cool down.After the pressure gets released, open the pressure cooker, drain and retain the","Add 1/ 2 cup water, preferably the water which was used to boil the pumpkin.Knead well to make a soft dough","Do not flatten the dough like regular pooris, as the wade will be crispy.Flatten them a bit thicker than that we do for ","One by one flatten all the balls into small thick pooris and keep them ready on a separate plate.In a kadai or wok, add ","Let the oil get heated","Now add one flattened wade/poori into the hot oil carefully.Using a frying spoon or slotted spoon gently press the poori","At this point, turn it to the other side and fry till it turns golden brown ✅"] },
