"shrimp_stir_fry_with_cheesy_dip_mayo_recipe": { title: "Shrimp Stir Fry With Cheesy Dip Mayo Recipe", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1/2 Green Bell Pepper (Capsicum) - julienned","1/2 Yellow Bell Pepper (Capsicum) - julienned","2 tablespoon Del Monte Cheesy Dip","1/2 Red Bell pepper (Capsicum) - julienned","1/2 cup Broccoli - chopped florets","15 Shrimps - de-veined","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","7 Garlic - minced","1 teaspoon Soy sauce","1 Onion - finely chopped","1/2 tablespoon Garam masala powder","1/2 teaspoon Salt"], product_ids: [545,2307,2311,973,1840,1843,2300,476], steps: ["To prepare Shrimp Stir Fry With Cheesy Dip Mayo Recipe, de-vein the shrimps","Wash and marinate them with the ingredients mentioned for marination","Keep them aside for 30 minutes.Heat a wok/kadai and add oil","Once the oil is heated, add chopped onion and fry till onion turns translucent","Add garlic and saute till the raw smell of garlic goes away.Add tomato and fry till tomatoes turns mushy and cooked well","Add the bell peppers and broccoli florets and stir fry until cooked.Now add the marinated shrimps and cook for 12-15 min","Check the taste and adjust the flavors accordingly Once done, stir in the basil leaves and turn off the heat.Serve Shrim"] },
"ginger_holi_basil_teasene_ginger_basil_tea_recipe": { title: "Ginger-Holi Basil Teasene - Ginger Basil Tea Recipe", serves: "3", time: "7 min", category: "☕ Beverage", all_ingredients: ["2 inch Ginger - (adjust)","4 teaspoons Honey - (optional)","1/2 Lemon - squeezed","2 cups Water","12 Tulsi (holy basil)"], product_ids: [48,2314,2300,927], steps: ["To begin making the Ginger-Holy Basil Tisane - Adrak Tulsi Chai Recipe, wash and clean the ginger thoroughly","Then grate it without peeling","Drizzle honey, squeeze lemon juice and give a quick stir","Serve hot.Drink Ginger-Holy Basil Tisane - Adrak Tulsi Chai Recipe on empty stomach ✅"] },
"a_creamy_delicious_gulkand_kulfi_recipe": { title: "A Creamy & Delicious Gulkand Kulfi Recipe", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Gulkand","3 liter Milk - (use 2% fat milk)","1/4 cup Gulkand","1/2 teaspoon Betel Nut (Supari)","1/4 cup Badam (Almond) - powdered","1/2 cup Sugar","1 teaspoon Fennel seeds (Saunf) - powdered"], product_ids: [2307,2314,4141,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Creamy Gulkand Kulfi Recipe, we will first have to condense the milk","For this heat milk in a heavy bottomed saucepan and bring the milk to a boil.Once the milk comes to a boil, turn the hea","Burning of milk is also toxic so you want to be extra careful.Once it is reduced to about more than half of its quantity","Finally stir in the fennel seed powder, almond powder saffron and gulkand into the Kulfi milk mixture.Turn off the heat ","Pour the Gulkand Kulfi mixture in the moulds until 3/4th full, seal them airtight and freeze them in the refrigerator.Th"] },
