"lauki_bharta_recipe_spiced_mashed_bottled_gourd_re": { title: "Lauki Bharta Recipe - Spiced & Mashed Bottled Gourd Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Red Chilli powder","1 tablespoon Garam masala powder","1 Bottle gourd (lauki) - grated","pinch Sugar","Salt - to taste","1 tablespoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1/2 tablespoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1 tablespoon Ginger Garlic Paste","2 Tomatoes","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - for garnishing","1 Onion - big sized","Sunflower Oil - as required"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,2314,973,462,476,2301], steps: ["To begin with the Lauki Bharta Recipe, first peel the lauki/bottle gourd and grate the bottle gourd","Keep this aside, as we proceed to make the masala for the bharta.In a wok heat a tablespoon of oil, add jeera and let it","Cover the pan and allow the lauki to cook in low to medium heat","The lauki will give out its own liquid as it comes in contact with salt","If required, add just a little more water to cook the bottle gourd","Cook till the lauki is cooked and is well combined with the spices","At this stage, add garam masala powder, cook further till until combined and the lauki bharta consistency should remain ","Chesck the salt and spices and adjust to suit your taste.Once done, turn off the heat and stir in chopped coriander leav"] },
"chicken_manchurian_recipe": { title: "Chicken Manchurian Recipe", serves: "3", time: "65 min", category: "🥡 Indo-Chinese", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Soy sauce","3 tablespoons Red Chilli sauce","1 Whole Egg","1 teaspoon Soy sauce","1 teaspoon Chilli vinegar","2 inch Ginger - finely grated","300 grams Chicken - chopped to bite size pieces","1 cup Water","1 Green Bell Pepper (Capsicum) - thinly sliced","2 Green Chillies - finely chopped","2 tablespoons Corn flour","1 tablespoon Corn flour"], product_ids: [545,2307,2311,973,1840,1842,4148,2300], steps: ["Heat a skillet, heat 1 tablespoon of oil on a medium heat.Once the oil is hot, reduce the heat to medium and add marinat","Once the chicken is cooked, skim the the chicken to drain excess over and place them over a paper napkin","In a mixing bowl add corn flour, soy sauce, red chilli garlic sauce, tomato puree, chilli vinegar and water- mix well un","The sauce for the Chicken Manchurian gravy is ready","Now, heat a wok with 1 tablepoon of oil","Once the oil is hot, add garlic and ginger and saute till they become soft.Add in chopped spring onions and saute for fe","Add onions and green bell peppers and saute till onions turn translucent","Add green chillies and saute till they are a bit tender and they impart the pungency into the dish ✅"] },
"mahunada_khaja_recipe_rose_cookie_recipe": { title: "Mahunada Khaja Recipe - Rose Cookie Recipe", serves: "3", time: "20 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1 cup All Purpose Flour (Maida)","1 cup Milk","2 teaspoon Sesame seeds (Til seeds)","1/2 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","1 cup Caster Sugar","1/2 cup Rice flour","Sunflower Oil - to cook"], product_ids: [2307,2314,4141,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin making Mahunada Khaja Recipe (Andhra Style Gulabi Puvvulu), take all dry ingredients in a mixing bowl and add m","Using a whisk, mix this well till combined","The batter should be semi thick consistency.Also heat the cooking oil for deep frying, on medium heat.Keep the mould ins","Here is the tricky part, just fill the mould to half so that the batter does not stick to upper most part of the mould","Any batter sticking to the upper part of the mould results in being unable to unmold the cookies.Now dip the mould into ","Immerse it in hot oil for some time.When it changes colour and is about half done, take the sauté stick and just scrape ","This stage ensures that the Mahunada Khaja does not loose its shape.After about a minutes, remove from hot oil","Remember that it will further crisp up when cooling.Repeat the same process till the batter is completed ✅"] },
