"drumstick_spinach_fry_recipe_moringa_aloe_sabiji": { title: "Drumstick Spinach Fry Recipe - Moringa Aloe Sabiji", serves: "3", time: "55 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1/2 teaspoon Mustard seeds","Sunflower Oil - for cooking","300 grams Drumstick Leaves (Moringa/Murungai Keerai) - washed and chopped","Salt - to taste","1 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","1 Onion - finely chopped","3 Potato (Aloo) - boiled and cut into cubes","1 inch Ginger - finely chopped","1/4 teaspoon Sambar Powder"], product_ids: [2307,973,464,2300,473,476,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Murunga Keerai Urula Poriyal Recipe; we will first cook the drumstick leaves and potato separately","Heat a teaspoon of oil in a pan; add the chopped drumstick leaves, a little salt and saute the moringa leaves until it b","Once soft increase the heat to high and saute the drumstick leaves until all the water from the drumstick leaves is vapo","Turn off the heat, transfer the drumstick leaves to another dish and keep aside.Wipe the same pan clean with the paper t","Heat a tablespoon of oil; add in the mustard seeds, ginger, onions and sauté until the onions are lightly browned.Add th","At this stage stir in the sautéed moringa leaves.Cover the pan and simmer the Murunga Keerai Urula Poriyal for another c","Turn off the heat, transfer the poriyal to a serving dish.Serve the Murunga Keerai Urula Poriya along with Thakkali Veng"] },
"masala_lemonade_recipe": { title: "Masala Lemonade Recipe", serves: "3", time: "10 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1/4 teaspoon Black pepper powder","1 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","3 Lemons - juiced","4 cups Water","1 cup Sugar","Mint Leaves (Pudina) - a handful","1 teaspoon Black Salt (Kala Namak)","1 pinch Cooking soda - (optional)","1/2 inch Ginger - crushed"], product_ids: [2307,2314,48,946,2300,2302], steps: ["You can add soda if you like your lemonade to be fizzy.Serve this coolant Masala Lemonade Recipe during tea time along w"] },
