"banana_bread_with_chocolate_chips_and_walnut_recip": { title: "Banana Bread With Chocolate Chips And Walnut Recipe", serves: "3", time: "70 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["3 tablespoon Sunflower Oil","1 teaspoon Baking powder","4 Ripe Bananas","100 grams Sugar","1/2 cup Chocolate chips","100 grams Brown Sugar (Demerara Sugar)","1 teaspoon Vanilla Extract","1/2 cup Walnuts","100 grams Butter - melted","2 Whole Eggs","1 1/2 cup All Purpose Flour (Maida)"], product_ids: [2314,15,4144,4148,27,2300,2301], steps: ["Now on the other hand grind the bananas into a nice pureeAdd the Banana's and sugar mixture into another bowl and mix th","To this mixture add some vanilla essence and butter and give it a good mix until they combine together","Now Add this mixture to the flour and also add the whisked eggs, oil","With a hand blender mix the mixture","Now once you get a good mix add chocolate chips and give a light mix to the flour mix ✅"] },
"rustic_rosemary_garlic_zucchini_bread_recipe": { title: "Rustic Rosemary Garlic Zucchini Bread Recipe", serves: "3", time: "100 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1 teaspoon Sugar","1 cup All Purpose Flour (Maida)","1 1/4 teaspoon Active dry yeast","1/2 tablespoon Rosemary - finely chopped","2 tablespoons Water - to add to the dough","1 tablespoon Sunflower seeds","2 cups Whole Wheat Flour","1 1/2 cup Green zucchini - shredded","1 tablespoon Garlic - minced","3/4 teaspoon Salt","1/4 cup Lukewarm Water"], product_ids: [2307,2314,460,1844,2300,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Rustic Rosemary Garlic Zucchini Bread Recipe, combine spelt bread flour and all purpose flour, yeast","Dough should come together well at this point; slightly sticky is fine.Place dough ball in well oiled bowl, turning doug","Place in warm, draft-free area to rise until zucchini bread dough is doubled in size.After dough has doubled, divide the","The bread loaves should sound hollow when tapped on the back side.Once done, remove the Zucchini Bread from the oven and","Let the butter melt softening the crust.Allow them to cool completely on a wire rack","Serve the Rustic Rosemary Garlic Zucchini Bread along with Pasta In Roasted Red Pepper Sauce for weekend dinner ✅"] },
"puri_for_pani_puri_recipe_golagappa_puchka_puri_re": { title: "Puri For Pani Puri Recipe - Golagappa / Puchka Puri Recipe", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["Sunflower Oil - for deep frying","1 tablespoon All Purpose Flour (Maida)","1/2 teaspoon Salt","1 tablespoon Sunflower Oil","1 cup Sooji (Semolina/ Rava)","1/4 cup Lukewarm Water"], product_ids: [460,2301,2302,2300], steps: ["To begin making the Puri for Pani Puri, in a large bowl, add in the salt, sooji rava and the warm water","Mix the ingredients well until the sooji rava has absorbed all the water","The mixture will resemble a wet crumb texture.With this existing moisture we need to make this into a smooth dough","For that add in a tablespoon of maida (all purpose flour)","This flour is to absorb that extra moisture and give it a bit of gluten for the dough","Resist the temptation to add more flour, this will alter the texture of the puri for the pani puriKnead this dough well ","It will be easier to knead it on your kitchen platform rather than the bowl","You can use both your hands and muscle power to get the sooji rava mixture into a consistency of a smooth dough ✅"] },
