"badusha_recipe_balushahi_recipe_sweet_indian_dough": { title: "Badusha Recipe | Balushahi Recipe - Sweet Indian Doughnut", serves: "3", time: "70 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1/4 cup Ghee","1 cup All Purpose Flour (Maida)","Sunflower Oil - for deep frying","1/4 cup Pistachios - roughly chopped","1/4 teaspoon Salt","1 cup Sugar","1 teaspoon Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","1/4 cup Curd (Dahi / Yogurt) - chilled","1/4 cup Water","1/4 teaspoon Baking soda"], product_ids: [2307,2314,4140,4142,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Balushahi (Badusha) recipe, we have to follow a two stage cooking process","First is to make the fried dough and second the sugar syrup","To make the dough In a large bowl add in the flour, the salt and a 1/4 teaspoon of soda","Stir to combine the dry ingredients","Next add in the ghee to the flour mixture","Using your fingers combine the flour and ghee to make coarse crumbs","Its takes a good one minute to get this texture","Once you get the coarse crumbs texture, add in the yogurt ✅"] },
