"ellu_kuzhambu_recipe_sesame_seeds_kuzhambu": { title: "Ellu Kuzhambu Recipe- Sesame Seeds Kuzhambu", serves: "3", time: "35 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["2 Potatoes (Aloo) - cut into cubes","1/2 teaspoon Mustard seeds","1 tablespoon Black sesame seeds","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1/2 teaspoon Black pepper powder","1 tablespoon Sesame seeds (Til seeds)","Salt - as per required","1 teaspoon Chana dal (Bengal Gram Dal)","25 grams Tamarind","2 Tomatoes - finely chopped","1/4 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1/2 teaspoon Methi Seeds (Fenugreek Seeds)"], product_ids: [545,929,2307,2308,2311,13,973,2300], steps: ["Transfer into a bowl and keep aside.Next in the same pan dry roast urad dal and chana dal till the dals turn golden brow","Once done remove into a bowl and keep aside to cool.Finally dry roast the cumin seeds till they start to change colour a","Once the sesame seeds and the dals have cooled down add them to the mixer grinder along with the black pepper powder and","Let the seeds splutter and add onions & saute till golden brown.Once the onions have browned add tomatoes, chilli powder","Once the tomatoes have turned soft add the tamarind extract & boil until the raw smell of the tamarind vanishes.Once don","After 2-3 minutes, turn off the heat and your Ellu Kuzhambu is ready to be served.Serve Ellu Kuzhambu with Steamed Rice,"] },
