"eggless_whole_wheat_banana_muffins_recipe": { title: "Eggless Whole Wheat Banana Muffins Recipe", serves: "3", time: "60 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["3/4 cup Caster Sugar","1 Pinch Salt","1 teaspoon Baking powder","1/2 cup Cashew nuts - chopped","4 Ripe Bananas - mashed","3/4 cup Milk","1/2 cup Sunflower Oil","1 cup Whole Wheat Flour"], product_ids: [2314,4141,15,27,2300,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin with Eggless Whole Wheat Banana Muffins, firstly sift the flour, baking powder, powdered sugar and salt and mix","Keep it aside.In an another bowl, mash the bananas by hand or with a fork","Add vegetable oil and milk and whisk well","You can use hand mixer too for mixing.Add cashew-nut pieces and mix everything well.Pre-heat the oven for 5 Minutes at 1","Line the muffin tray with cupcake covers and fill them with the prepared batter.Fill only till 3/4th of the cupcake cove","Bake them for about 25-30 minutes","Keep checking after 20 minutes that the muffins are ready or not.To check if the muffin is baked, pierce a toothpick at ","If the toothpick comes out clean, then it is baked properly ✅"] },
