"foxtail_millet_kheer_recipe_millet_pudding_with_sa": { title: "Foxtail Millet Kheer Recipe (Millet Pudding With Saffron & Nuts)", serves: "3", time: "75 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["1/4 cup Mixed dry fruits - (like almonds","5 Saffron strands","1/4 cup Sugar","50 grams Foxtail Millet","1 liter Milk","2 tablespoon Fresh coconut - grated"], product_ids: [9,2314,4141], steps: ["Allow the milk to come to a quick boil.Once the milk comes to a boil, turn the heat to low and simmer the kheer until th","This will take about 10 to 15 minutes","(You will have to take a bite to check)Once the foxtail millet has cooked through completely, add in the freshly grated ","Check the sweetness at this stage and adjust to suit your taste ✅"] },
