"osmania_biscuits_recipe": { title: "Osmania Biscuits Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["3 tablespoons Milk Powder","200 grams Butter (unsalted)","100 grams Sugar","2 teaspoons Baking powder","260 grams Vivatta Maida","Milk - to brush before baking","1 tablespoon Soy flour - toasted (optional)","1 teaspoon Salt"], product_ids: [2314,4141,4144,2300,2302], steps: ["To begin making Osmania Biscuits Recipe, line two baking sheets with parchment paper and set aside.Sift the all purpose ","Cream the butter using a silicon or rubber spatula until softened","Once all the flour is mixed in, with light hands knead or massage the mixture in order to incorporate some air.After a c","Now add milk powder, soy flour and powdered sugar","Using standard round cookie cutter cut out cookies of approximately 3 inches in diameter.Place them on prepared baking s","Brush their top with milk at room temperature.Place them in the refrigerator while we preheat the oven at 200 degree cel","Bake them for 20 to 25 minutes until golden brown.Place them on wire rack and cool them to room temperature","Store in airtight container ✅"] },
