"millet_energy_bites_with_almonds_dates_and_coconut": { title: "Millet Energy Bites With Almonds, Dates And Coconut Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Dates","1/2 cup Ragi Flour (Finger Millet/ Nagli)","1/2 cup Honey","1/2 cup Bajra Flour ( Pearl Millet)","1 cup Badam (Almond) - whole","1 cup Dessicated Coconut"], product_ids: [9,2314,13], steps: ["To begin making Millet Energy Bites with Almonds, Dates and Coconut recipe, firstly dry roast the ragi and bajra flour i","Remove from the heat and let it cool completely.In a mixer grinder, add the millet flours, dates, almonds and coconut fl","Give it about 8 to 10 pulses, until the almonds, dates and coconuts and all shredded down uniformly.Add honey now, and g","They can be stored at room temperature","Chilling it in the fridge will keep if fresh for up to two weeks.Serve Millet Energy Bites With Almonds, Dates And Cocon"] },
"kauni_rice_paniyaram_recipe_fruit_rice_paniyaram_r": { title: "Kauni Rice Paniyaram Recipe (Fruit Rice Paniyaram Recipe)", serves: "3", time: "260 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Black Rice","Health Mix - (optional)","2 tablespoons Whole Wheat Flour","Sunflower Oil - for frying in paniyaram pan","6 tablespoons Palm jaggery - powder"], product_ids: [2314,2301], steps: ["To begin making Kavuni Arisi Paniyaram, wash and soak the rice in enough water for about 4 hours","Once done, drain the rice from water and add it to a mixer","Add 1/2 a cup or required amount of drained water to the rice and grind into smooth batter.Transfer the batter into a mi","You can also add 2-3 tablespoons of health mix or sathu maavu to the mixture, this step is optional","Mix everything together into dosa batter consistency.Heat a paniyaram pan adding required amount of oil","Once the pan is hot, ladle the batter into all holes and cook in medium flame until golden","Put the lid of the pan on so that the paniyarams cook/steam","Open the lid in intervals of a 30 seconds to check if the paniyarams are cooked ✅"] },
