"frozen_mango_yogurt_recipe_mango_froyo": { title: "Frozen Mango Yogurt Recipe-Mango Froyo", serves: "3", time: "90 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["2 cups Curd (Dahi / Yogurt)","1 pinch Saffron strands - soaked in 2 tablespoons milk","1 pinch Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","2 Mango (Ripe) - peeled & chopped","2-3 tablespoons Sugar - (adjust)"], product_ids: [1,2307,2314,4141,4142], steps: ["To begin making the Mango Froyo -Frozen Yogurt Recipe, first drain the yogurt by pouring it into a fine sieve, lined wit","Place a bowl below to collect the whey, and leave aside for about an hour or till all the excess water content is draine","Once the whey is drained yogurt looks like the soft cheese","Transfer to a bowl","Add the hung yogurt in the blender along with the chopped mangoes, saffron and cardamom powder","Blend into a smooth puree","Taste and add adjust the amount of sugar accordingly","You can replace the sugar with honey as well if you like.Pour the mixture into a freezer-safe box, seal the box with the"] },
"dhingri_matar_recipe": { title: "Dhingri Matar Recipe", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["oil - as per use","4 Bud garlic","1 tablespoon poppy seeds","1/4 cup green peas - steam","400 grams Button mushroom","5 cashews","2 cups tomato puree","salt - as per taste","1/2 teaspoon turmeric powder","1 cup soy chunks","1 inch ginger","1 teaspoon garam masala powder"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,973,503,1850,2300,2301], steps: ["To make Dhingri Peas, first make ginger garlic paste and keep it aside","Now add poppy seeds, cashew and a little water in a mixer","Make a paste and keep it separately","Now soak the soya chunks in hot water for 15 minutes and keep them aside","Now heat oil in a pan","Add ginger garlic paste to it and cook for 1 minute","Now add tomato puree, turmeric powder and let it cook for 2 minutes","Now add peas, soya chunks, mushrooms and let it cook till the mushroom becomes soft ✅"] },
"homemade_black_bean_burger_recipe": { title: "Homemade Black Bean Burger Recipe", serves: "3", time: "75 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Canned black beans","1 inch Ginger - grated","2 cloves Garlic - grated","1/2 cup Whole Wheat Bread crumbs","1 Onion - finely chopped","2 tablespoons Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Mint Leaves (Pudina) - a small bunch finely chopped","1/2 cup Oats Flour"], product_ids: [2307,4143,946,476,2301,2303], steps: ["Transfer the mixer to a large mixing bowl and check the salt and spices","Adjust to suit your taste","Shape the black bean burger pattie into 4 medium size patties and refrigerate for 30 minutes","The size of the pattie will depend on the size of your burger bun","The next step is to cook the patties on a skillet","Preheat and grease the skillet with oil","Place the burger patties on the preheated skillet and cook until browned on both sides","You can optionally drizzle a bit of oil and continue to cook.Once burger patties are browned evenly turn off the heat ✅"] },
"nando_s_peri_peri_chicken_recipe": { title: "Nando's Peri Peri Chicken Recipe", serves: "3", time: "20 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Lemon juice","100 grams Nando's Peri Peri Chicken Marinade","2 tablespoons Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - small bunch","2 Fresh Red chillies - chopped (optional)","400 grams Boneless chicken"], product_ids: [930,973,4143,48,2301,2303], steps: ["To begin making Nando's Peri Peri Chicken Recipe, add the chicken to a zip-closed bag and pour the marinade over top","Close the top and toss the chicken","Marinate overnight.Heat the oil in a shallow fry pan over medium heat, place chicken pieces in and cook until fully cook","Or you can deep fry them instead, as well ✅"] },
"thandai_panna_cotta_with_strawberry_and_mango_coul": { title: "Thandai Panna Cotta With Strawberry And Mango Coulis Recipe", serves: "3", time: "300 min", category: "🥤 Smoothie", all_ingredients: ["1 tablespoon Lemon juice","2 teaspoon Lemon juice","2 cups Fresh cream","2 teaspoon Gelatin","2 tablespoons Thandai Masala - or syrup","4 tablespoons Sugar","1/2 cup Milk","200 grams Strawberries - hulled","1 cup Mango Pulp (Puree)","3 tablespoons Sugar","2 tablespoons Water"], product_ids: [1,2307,2314,4141,48,4148,2300], steps: ["To begin with Thandai Panna Cotta With Strawberry And Mango Coulis, firstly we will start making the strawberry coulis.P","Transfer mixture to a saucepan over medium-high heat and bring it to a boil.Continue to boil until mixture thickens to s","Strain and set it aside to cool","Pour into glasses, cover with foil/ cling film and freeze till set.In the meanwhile, prepare the thandai","Pour 1/2 cup of milk into a mixing bowl and evenly sprinkle some gelatin on top; set aside for two minutes.Place 1-1/2 c","Keep whisking almost continuously.Let the thandai cream mixture come to room temperature","Once cool, whip up the remaining 1/2 cup of cream and gently fold it into the panna cotta.Now pour it over the strawberr","You just have to use chopped mangoes instead of strawberries ✅"] },
"green_peas_potato_and_paneer_tikki_recipe": { title: "Green Peas, Potato and Paneer Tikki Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["1/2 teaspoon Cumin powder (Jeera)","2 sprig Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","Salt - to taste","3 tablespoons Sunflower Oil","3 Potatoes (Aloo) - boiled and mashed","1 inch Ginger - grated","2 Green Chillies - finely chopped","1 Onions - finely chopped","1/2 teaspoon Red Chilli powder","1/2 cup Instant Oats (Oatmeal)","3/4 cup Green peas (Matar) - steamed","100 grams Paneer (Homemade Cottage Cheese) - grated"], product_ids: [930,2307,973,4145,2300,503,4152,473], steps: ["To begin making the Green Peas, Potato and Paneer Tikki Recipe, first combine all the ingredients in a large mixing bowl","Check the salt and spice levels and adjust to suit your taste","The next step is to shape the tikkis into medium size discs","Divide the Green Peas Potato Paneer Tikki mixture into equal size portions and shape them into 1/2 inch thick discs.Once","Heat oil in a large skillet or pan and shallow fry the tikkis for 10-12 minutes on each side till golden brown and cooke","Once the Green Peas, Potato and Paneer Tikki have cooked through, remove them from the pan and drain the excess oil in a","Arrange the Green Peas, Potato and Paneer Tikkis on a serving platter and serve it along with Green Chutney and Date Tam","Serve the Green Peas, Potato and Paneer Tikkis, along with a Tetley Lemon & Honey Green Tea and stay light, fit and heal"] },
"field_thepla_recipe": { title: "Field Thepla Recipe", serves: "3", time: "50 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["1 Green Chilli - finely chopped","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1 cup Bottle gourd (lauki) - peeled and grated","1 teaspoon Garam masala powder","Salt - to taste","1-1/2 cups Whole Wheat Flour","1/2 cup Gram flour (besan)","2 tablespoons Hung Curd (Greek Yogurt)","2 tablespoons Ghee","2 teaspoons Red Chilli powder","2 tablespoon Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","1 inch Ginger - peeled and crushed into paste"], product_ids: [930,2307,2308,2314,4140,973,4142,462], steps: ["To begin making the Lauki Thepla Recipe, in a mixing bowl, add wheat flour, gram flour, turmeric powder, red chili powde","Keep on mixing till a firm dough is formed.Add curd only if needed","Normally bottlegourd releases water","But if the dough becomes too dry, add curd little at a time and make firm dough.Do not let the dough rest as the bottle ","Dust the rolling board with flour","Flatten the dough balls and roll it into thin theplas","Do not make them thick.Heat a tawa, spread 1 teaspoon ghee","Fry the thepla by applying ghee on both sides ✅"] },
