"mysore_rasam_recipe": { title: "Mysore Rasam Recipe", serves: "3", time: "15 min", category: "🍵 Soup", all_ingredients: ["2 sprig Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","1/2 cup Arhar dal (Split Toor Dal) - cooked","20 grams Tamarind - lemon sized","1 teaspoon Mustard seeds","2 teaspoons Ghee","Salt - Salt for taste","1/2 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1/2 teaspoon Black pepper powder","1 Green Chilli - slit","2 Kashmiri dry red chillies","1/4 cup Fresh coconut - grated","2 teaspoons Chana dal (Bengal Gram Dal)"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,2308,2311,9,2314,4140], steps: ["To begin making Mysore Rasam, wash and pressure cook tur dal for 3 whistles","Allow the pressure to release naturally, mash dal and keep aside.Add a little lukewarm water to the tamarind, and extrac","Cool this mixture and make a fine powder using a mixer grinder","Serve Mysore Rasam along with Steamed Rice, Beetroot Palya, Salad and Papad for a delicious Karnataka meal for a weekday"] },
"mexican_taco_recipe_with_refried_beans_fresh_summe": { title: "Mexican Taco Recipe With Refried Beans & Fresh Summer Salad", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🥗 Salad", all_ingredients: ["4 Hard taco shells","1/4 cup Guacamole - homemade","1/4 cup Tomato Salsa - homemade","1 cup Summer Salad","1/2 cup Sour cream - homemade","1/2 cup Refried beans - homemade"], product_ids: [545,4141,4142], steps: ["To begin making the Classic Mexican Taco Recipe With Refried Beans & Fresh Summer Salad, keep the elements ready to asse","You can click on each one one of the links below to get the recipes of how to make these elements","First in put one and a half tablespoon of homemade refried beans right at the bottom and spread evenly","Next add a generous layer of fresh summer salad, over this salad spoon some homemade guacamole, and drizzle some homemad","Serve Classic Mexican Taco Recipe With Refried Beans & Fresh Summer Salad along with Kiwi Basil Lemonade Recipe and Stra"] },
