"vietnamese_chicken_potato_curry_recipe": { title: "Vietnamese Chicken & Potato Curry Recipe", serves: "3", time: "30 min", category: "🌍 World Cuisine", all_ingredients: ["1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1 teaspoon Black pepper corns","300 ml Coconut milk","2 Bay leaf (tej patta)","Salt - to taste","1 inch Cinnamon Stick (Dalchini)","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","4 cloves Garlic - finely chopped","2 Potato (Aloo) - skin peeled and cut into big chunks","2 Carrot (Gajjar) - skin peeled and cut into big chunks","2 Onion - sliced","1 teaspoon Fennel seeds (Saunf)"], product_ids: [930,2307,2308,9,2314,4141,1842,468], steps: ["To begin making the Vietnamese Chicken & Potato Curry Recipe, we will roast the whole spice for Vietnamese curry powder ","Roast the spice for at least 5 minutes until you get a good aroma from it","Once the whole spices are well roasted","Transfer it to a mixer and grind it into a smooth powder","In a mixing bowl, add the chicken pieces and half of the ground curry powder and turmeric powder","Mix well and rest for at least 30 minutes, keep it ready to roast them","To make the Vietnamese chicken curry, you can keep pressure cooker over medium heat","Drizzle some oil, add the marinated chicken pieces and roast them for at least 3 minutes ✅"] },
