"spicy_and_delicious_chicken_teriyaki_noodle_recipe": { title: "Spicy And Delicious Chicken Teriyaki Noodle Recipe", serves: "3", time: "45 min", category: "🍝 Pasta", all_ingredients: ["1 Onion - sliced","100 grams Chicken - shredded","1 inch Ginger - chopped","3 tablespoons Sprig Ginger Teriyaki Sauce","Salt and Pepper - to taste","2 cups Egg noodles - (Flat) boiled","1 Green bell peppers - julienned","1/2 Green zucchini - julienned","1 tablespoon Sunflower Oil","4 cloves Garlic - chopped","2 tablespoons Soy sauce","1 tablespoon Red Chilli sauce"], product_ids: [2307,2311,2314,973,1840,468,1844,4148], steps: ["To begin making the Chicken Teriyaki Noodle Recipe,follow how to make these flat noodles at home to make noodles.We will","Once the noodles are cooked, drain all the water and rinse the noodles over a running cold water","This is done in order to stop the noodles from cooking further","Drizzle some oil over the noodles, mix and keep it aside","In a bowl, add the shredded chicken pieces and two tablespoons of Teriyaki Sauce","Coat the chicken pieces with the sauce and let it marinate for at least 20 minutes","In a wok, add a tablespoon of oil and let it heat up","Once the oil is hot, add the chopped ginger and garlic and saute till they soften ✅"] },
"beetroot_tambuli_beetroot_raita_with_coconut_recip": { title: "Beetroot Tambuli (Beetroot Raita With Coconut) Recipe", serves: "3", time: "40 min", category: "🥗 Salad", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Curd (Dahi / Yogurt)","2 Green Chillies","1/2 teaspoon Mustard seeds","1 inch Ginger - chopped","Salt - to taste","10 Whole Black Peppercorns","1 to 2 Dry Red Chilli","3/4 cup Fresh coconut - grated","1 sprig Curry leaves","1 cup Beetroot - grated","1/2 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","2 teaspoons Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - chopped"], product_ids: [930,2307,9,2314,973,4142,1842,470], steps: ["It will take about 1-2 minutes.Add these into a small blender and blend it without adding any water.To the same pan, add","Saute until it becomes soft and tender","Allow it to cool.Once it is done, add the beetroot to the coconut mixture and blend it to a coarse textured paste in a b","Heat oil in a tadka pan and add mustard, hing, curry leaves and red chillies","Spoon the tempering on the Beetroot Tambuli and it is ready to be served.Serve Beetroot Tambuli with Mixed Vegetable sam"] },
"malpua_with_rose_and_saffron_syrup_recipe": { title: "Malpua With Rose And Saffron Syrup Recipe", serves: "3", time: "130 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["1/4 teaspoon Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds - crushed","2 cup Sugar","1/3 cup Khoya (Mawa)","1 cup Milk","1/2 teaspoon Fennel seeds (Saunf) - crushed","1/4 cup Raisins","5 Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds","Pistachios - or almonds to garnish","8 Saffron strands","2 tablespoons Sugar","1 teaspoon Rose Essence","1/2 cup All Purpose Flour (Maida)"], product_ids: [2307,8,2314,460,4141,2300,2301], steps: ["To begin with Malpua With Rose And Saffron Syrup, pour the milk into a saucepan and let it boil","Switch off the heat when it reaches the boiling point.Add semolina/suji to the milk and mix well","Let it stand for 15-20 min and again mix it properly.Add flour, sugar and mawa, mix well","Grate the mawa/khoya before adding to the mixture.Add crushed fennel seeds, cardamom seeds and raisins and mix it gently","Cover the mixture and let it stand for at least an hour.The next step is to make the syrup","Add measured amount of sugar and water in a saucepan and let it boil","As the sugar dissolves completely, lower the heat to medium.Add cardamoms, saffron and rose to flavour the syrup","Keep the syrup hot.Now to make the pancakes/malpuas, heat sufficient oil in a deep fry pan for frying ✅"] },
