"spiced_turnips_with_spinach_recipe": { title: "Spiced Turnips with Spinach Recipe", serves: "3", time: "75 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1 Onion - sliced","2 sprig Coriander (Dhania) Leaves - finely chopped","3/4 teaspoon Coriander Powder (Dhania)","1 teaspoon Garlic - paste(optional)","Salt - to taste","1/2 teaspoon Ginger - paste","Red Chilli powder - to taste","3/4 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1 Spinach Leaves (Palak) - bunch","Sunflower Oil - to cook","2 Tomatoes - chopped","3/4 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,973,4143,2300,923,476], steps: ["To start preparing Spiced Turnips with Spinach Recipe, get all the ingredients handy","In a pan, heat oil","Cover and cook for another 2 minutes till done.Add turnips, mix it well","Cover it and cook on a low flame till it 3/4th done, takes about 5-10 minutes.Add chopped spinach, green/red chillies an","Mix well, cover it and cook on a low flame till it changes the colour or looks roasted.Serve the prepared Spiced Turnips"] },
