"kadhai_tofu_sabji": { title: "Kadhai Tofu Sabji", serves: "4", time: "30 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["250 grams Tofu - firm","1 Green Bell Pepper (Capsicum) - diced","1 Onion - diced","1 teaspoon Garlic - paste","1 teaspoon Ginger - paste","2 Tomatoes - blanched","1 teaspoon Cumin seeds (Jeera)","1 teaspoon Kasuri Methi (Dried Fenugreek Leaves) - crushed","1 tablespoon Sunflower Oil","1/2 teaspoon Turmeric powder (Haldi)","1/2 teaspoon Sugar","Salt - to taste"], product_ids: [1,930,545,929,2307,2314,973,1840], steps: ["To begin making the Kadai Tofu Sabji, first make the dry masala.In a small pan, dry roast the coriander seeds, peppercor","Cool and coarsely grind it in a blender along with the Anardana and dry mango powder.Now we will make the Kadai Tofu Sab","Add the Tofu cubes, sprinkle salt and sugar.Mix nicely so that the masala coats the Tofu cubes ✅"] },
