"prawn_masala_rice": { title: "Prawn Masala Rice", serves: "4", time: "30 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["1 cup Basmati rice","2 Bay leaves (tej patta)","2 Onions","5 cloves Garlic","1/2 inch Ginger","1 teaspoon Soy sauce","1/2 Carrot (Gajjar)","1 teaspoon Green Chilli Sauce","1/2 Red Yellow or Green Bell Pepper (Capsicum)","1 teaspoon Roasted tomato pasta sauce","8 Prawns - marinated","1 tablespoon Butter"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,2308,2311,2314,973,1840], steps: ["To begin making the Prawn Masala Rice Recipe, firstly marinate the prawns by applying chilly powder, turmeric powder and","Then add the paste made out of garlic and ginger","Let it get fried for sometime.Add the veggies and fry for sometime","Add butter and mix properly.Switch off the gas and garnish with chopped coriander leaves.Serve Prawn Masala Rice Recipe "] },
