"gongura_pappu_recipe_gongura_sorrel_leaves_dal": { title: "Gongura Pappu Recipe - Gongura/ Sorrel Leaves Dal", serves: "4", time: "45 min", category: "🫘 Dal", all_ingredients: ["Arhar dal (Split Toor Dal)","Red Chilli powder","Turmeric powder (Haldi)","Sorrel Leaves (Gongura)","Pearl onions (Sambar Onions)","Green Chillies","Curry leaves","Garlic","Dry Red Chillies","Sesame (Gingelly) Oil","Salt"], product_ids: [2307,2308,2314,973,13,503,920,476], steps: ["To begin making the Gongura Pappu, first pressure cook toor dal along with chili powder, haldi and with three cups of wa","Allow the pressure to release naturally, as the dal will continue to cook while there is pressure","Next heat oil in a pan and add dry red chilies,curry leaves, crushed garlic, chopped onions, green chilies and salt and ","Then add Gongura leaves/ Sorrel Leaves to the pan and cook till the sorrel leaves reduce and wilt. The gongura leaves ta","Once done, add the cooked Gongura leaves to the cooked dal in the pressure cooker and simmer for five minutes until the ","Once done, check the taste and adjust the salt and seasonings accordingly","Transfer the Gongura Pappu to a serving bowl and serve hot","Serve Gongura Pappu along with ✅"] },
