"papitha_nu_shaak_recipe_raw_green_papaya_sabzi": { title: "Papitha Nu Shaak Recipe (Raw Green Papaya Sabzi)", serves: "4", time: "40 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["Raw papaya","Gram flour (besan)","Mustard seeds","Cumin seeds (Jeera)","Asafoetida (hing)","Turmeric powder (Haldi)","Green Chillies","Sunflower Oil","Salt"], product_ids: [2307,2308,12,973,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Papitha Nu Shaak recipe, first cut the peeled papaya into thin slices. In a bowl combine the sliced ","Heat oil in a pan over medium heat. Add the mustard seeds, cumin seeds into the hot oil and allow them to crackle.Now ad","Add the gram flour coated papaya into the pan and stir to combine. Turn the heat to low and cook the papaya for few minu","Transfer Papitha Nu Shaak to a serving bowl. Serve the Papitha nu Sambhaar as a side dish with the main course or for lu"] },
"spaghetti_pomodoro_recipe_pasta_in_tomato_basil_sa": { title: "Spaghetti Pomodoro Recipe (Pasta in Tomato Basil Sauce)", serves: "4", time: "35 min", category: "🍝 Pasta", all_ingredients: ["Garlic","Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Basil leaves","Spaghetti Pasta","Red Chilli flakes","Salt","Whole Black Peppercorns","Parmesan cheese"], product_ids: [2303,2307,973,4145,1842,2301,2302,927], steps: ["To make the Pomodoro sauce, we will first make the tomato puree","While the sauce was simmering, bring water to boil in a large sauce pan. Season the water with some salt, add in the Spa","Once the spaghetti is cooked, drain pasta and keep it aside","Now to finish making the recipe we have to combine the cooked Spaghetti along with the Pomodoro sauce","To do this, add the pasta into the tomato basil pasta sauce and give it a good boil for about 3 to 4 minutes.  Once you ","Spoon the Spaghetti Pomodoro into individual serving bowls and sprinkle with Parmesan Cheese and serve warm for a weekni"] },
"vanilla_pound_cake_recipe": { title: "Vanilla Pound Cake Recipe", serves: "4", time: "50 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["Vivatta Maida","Corn flour","Sugar","Butter (unsalted)","Whole Eggs","Milk","Vanilla Extract","Baking powder","Salt"], product_ids: [2314,4141,4144,1842,4148,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Vanilla Pound Cake recipe, preheat your oven for 10 minutes at 170 degree C and line a loaf pan with","First mix eggs, milk, and vanilla extract in a bowl. Now with the help of a hand mixer or your electric mixer, combine a","Add butter and half of the wet ingredients (egg, milk, vanilla mixture) in the dry ingredients. Mix on low speed until a","Continue mixing untill you see the the batter getting light and airy. This will help in building structure of the cake","Slowly add remaining wet ingredients and combine well. This should take about a minute or two","Scrape the batter into the prepared pan and smooth the top with an offset spatula or the back of a spoon","Bake in medium rack of your oven at 170 degrees C for about 40-45 minutes or till the cake is done","Color of the cake will be golden brown and toothpick inserted in center of cake will come out clean, indicating cake is "] },
"red_chilli_thecha_recipe_in_hindi": { title: "Red Chilli Thecha (Recipe In Hindi)", serves: "4", time: "30 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["लाल मिर्च","Garlic","Sunflower Oil","Mustard seeds","Asafoetida (hing)","Salt"], product_ids: [2307,2301,2302], steps: ["लाल मिर्च थेचा बनाने के लिए सबसे पहले लाल मिर्च, लहसुन और नमक को एक ब्लेंडर में डाले और पीस ले. इस मिश्रण को एक बाउल में","अब एक तड़का पैन में तेल गरम करें। इसमें राइ डाले और 10 सेकण्ड्स तक पकने दे. अब इसमें हींग डाले और 20 सेकण्ड्स के बाद इस त","अच्छी तरह से मिला ले और परोसे। लाल मिर्च थेचा को","के साथ दिन के खाने के लिए परोसे। ✅"] },
"kavuni_arisi_paniyaram_recipe_black_rice_paniyaram": { title: "Kavuni Arisi Paniyaram Recipe (Black Rice Paniyaram Recipe)", serves: "4", time: "260 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["Black Rice","Palm jaggery","Whole Wheat Flour","Health Mix","Sunflower Oil"], product_ids: [2314,2301], steps: ["To begin making Kavuni Arisi Paniyaram, wash and soak the rice in enough water for about 4 hours. Once done, drain the r","Add 1/2 a cup or required amount of drained water to the rice and grind into smooth batter","Transfer the batter into a mixing bowl and add wheat flour and powdered palm and powered palm jaggery to it. You can als","Mix everything together into dosa batter consistency","Heat a paniyaram pan adding required amount of oil. Once the pan is hot, ladle the batter into all holes and cook in med","Open the lid in intervals of a 30 seconds to check if the paniyarams are cooked. Now, flip to the other side using a spo","The healthy and tasty Kavuni Arisi Karupatti Paniyaram is ready","Serve Kavuni Arisi Paniyaram at breakfast or at tea time as healthy snack along with a hot cup of ✅"] },
"lemon_blackberry_loaf_cake": { title: "Lemon Blackberry Loaf Cake", serves: "4", time: "50 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["All Purpose Flour (Maida)","Baking powder","Baking soda","Sugar","Whole Eggs","Lemon","Lemon juice","Vanilla Extract","Milk","Dried Blackberries"], product_ids: [48,2314,4148,4141], steps: ["To begin making Lemon Blackberry Loaf Cake, preheat oven at 180 degrees","Grease your baking tin/ load tin with cooking spray & dust some flour","Sieve flour, baking soda and baking powder together and set aside to be used later","Next, in a separate bowl beat butter and sugar until it gets light and fluffy","Take another bowl and whisk milk and eggs until combined","Now, add the flour mix little by little to the butter+sugar mix. Next, keep adding the milk+eggs mixture little by littl","Your batter should be smooth.Do not use a mixer when mixing, use a spatula instead","Add the lemon juice, lemon zest and vanilla essence to the batter ✅"] },
