"chickoo_banana_date_smoothie_recipe": { title: "Chickoo Banana Date Smoothie Recipe", serves: "4", time: "15 min", category: "🥤 Smoothie", all_ingredients: ["Chikoo (Sapota Fruit)","Ripe Bananas","Instant Oats (Oatmeal)","Dates","Milk","Ice cubes"], product_ids: [27,4141,15], steps: ["To begin making the Chickoo Banana Date Smoothie, blend all the ingredients together in a","with just half the milk, until smooth","Add the remaining milk and blend again to combine well. Pour the Chickoo Banana Date Smoothie into glasses and serve chi","Serve Chickoo Banana Date Smoothie Recipe with","for breakfast or with ✅"] },
"chilke_wali_mung_dal_curry_recipe": { title: "Chilke Wali Mung Dal Curry Recipe", serves: "4", time: "30 min", category: "🫘 Dal", all_ingredients: ["Green Moong Dal (Split)","Onion","Garlic","Cloves (Laung)","Cumin seeds (Jeera)","Green Chillies","Turmeric powder (Haldi)","Tomato","Salt","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,2308,973,503,476,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Chilke Wali Mung Dal Curry recipe, wash and drain the split mung bean dhal. Place in a pressure cook","Close the pressure pan and cook on high.  After one whistle, lower the heat and cook for about 10 minutes. You can cook ","Let the pressure drop on its own. Open the pressure pan and mash the dal. You may choose to make it into a fine paste or","In a deep kadai or saucepan, heat oil/ghee. Once the oil is hot, add cumin seeds and cloves; sauté for a few seconds","Add the finely chopped onions along with garlic and green chillies; fry for a few minutes till the onions are slightly s","Stir in tomatoes, turmeric powder and garam masala powder","Saute on medium low for a few minutes till the tomatoes are slightly cooked and soft. You will start to see the oil sepa","At this stage, add the cooked dal along with 1 to 1 ½ cups of water and salt to taste. Give it a good mix and taste for "] },
"cream_of_mushroom_spring_onion_soup_recipe": { title: "Cream Of Mushroom & Spring Onion Soup Recipe", serves: "4", time: "30 min", category: "🍵 Soup", all_ingredients: ["Button mushrooms","Spring Onion (Bulb & Greens)","Corn flour","Milk","Salt and Pepper","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves"], product_ids: [930,2307,4141,1842,1850,476,925,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Cream of Mushroom and Spring Onion Soup Recipe; heat oil in a large heavy saucepan; add the chopped ","The mushrooms will release a lot of water in the process. Do not discard the water. Add the salt and pepper and stir it ","Once the mushrooms are cooled a little, puree the mixture along with the rest of the ingredients until smooth or chunky ","Transfer the mushroom soup back to the saucepan and bring soup to a boil and cook until thickened","Adjust seasonings like salt and pepper to suit your taste. Finally stir in the chopped coriander leaves","Note you can adjust the consistency of the soup to be thicker or thinner by adding little or more water. The consistency","Serve the Cream of Mushroom and Spring Onion Soup along with toasted bread or along with a","for satiating dessert ✅"] },
"tikhat_rava_recipe_spicy_semolina_crumble": { title: "Tikhat Rava Recipe (Spicy Semolina Crumble)", serves: "4", time: "40 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["Sooji (Semolina/ Rava)","Sunflower Oil","Cumin seeds (Jeera)","Onion","Green peas (Matar)","Green Chilli","Curry leaves","Turmeric powder (Haldi)","Asafoetida (hing)","Salt","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves"], product_ids: [930,2307,460,973,503,920,476,2301], steps: ["To begin making the Tikhat Rava Recipe (Spicy Semolina Crumble), heat the ghee just until it melts. Add in the semolina ","Heat the oil and add the asafoetida, cumin, chopped chilli and the curry leaves. When the cumin and chillies start to sp","Add in 1-1/2 cups of water and wait for it to start boiling. Add in the peas and the semolina and mix well","You should still have a dry mixture as the water will have just about mixed with the semolina","Add in the salt and cover with a steel plate. Pour a little water into the steel plate, enough to cover the base. Let th","Stir after 6-8 minutes and check that the base is not browning. You can also taste the semolina at this stage to check i","Garnish the Tikhat Rava with coriander leaves and a squeeze of lemon juice","Serve Tikhat Rava Recipe (Spicy Semolina Crumble) with evening ✅"] },
