"arunachal_style_kharzi_rice_recipe": { title: "Arunachal Style Kharzi Rice Recipe", serves: "4", time: "25 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["Cooked rice","Dry Red Chillies","Mozzarella cheese","Ginger","Garlic","Tomato","Salt","Spring Onion (Bulb & Greens)","Green peas (Matar)","Oil"], product_ids: [545,973,4145,503,2301,476,925,2302], steps: ["To begin the preparation of Arunachal Style Kharzi Rice, soak dry red chillies in hot water for 10 to 15 minutes before ","Use leftover rice or cook rice and keep ready","Now take one sliced tomato, 3-4 soaked red chillies,garlic cloves, little ginger in blender, add 2 tablespoon mozzarella","Take a vessel and add just a teaspoon of oil and add this paste and saute on a very low flame to just leave the raw smel","Keep stirring continuously to prevent melted cheese from sticking to bottom. Add spring onions immediately and mix for f","Add hot rice and boiled peas to the above paste and mix","Serve Kharzi hot with ✅"] },
"moroccan_style_vegetable_stew_recipe": { title: "Moroccan Style Vegetable Stew Recipe", serves: "4", time: "55 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Onions","Garlic","Fresh cream","Cumin powder (Jeera)","Red Chilli powder","Cloves (Laung)","Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","Cinnamon Powder (Dalchini)","Potatoes (Aloo)","Kaddu (Parangikai/ Pumpkin)","Carrots (Gajjar)"], product_ids: [2307,2308,2314,973,4141,468,503,473], steps: ["To prepare Moroccan-Style Vegetable Stew Recipe, heat the oil in a large","over medium heat","Add the onion and the garlic, stirring until it gets tender and golden brown","Add the water or the stock, chili powder, cumin, cloves, cinnamon, cardamom, and salt. Allow it to boil for a few minute","Add the cream, potatoes, pumpkin/squash, carrots and chickpeas","Simmer covered for another 5 -10 minutes until the vegetables are tender and you start to feel the flavors emanating fro","Stir in the lemon juice after switching off heat, adorn the soup with parsley and serve Moroccan-Style Vegetable Stew Re"] },
"broccoli_quiche_recipe_with_eggless_option": { title: "Broccoli Quiche Recipe (with Eggless option)", serves: "4", time: "130 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["Garlic","Broccoli","Red Bell pepper (Capsicum)","Nutmeg","Red Chilli flakes","Cheddar cheese","Parmigiano reggiano cheese","Extra Virgin Olive Oil"], product_ids: [2307,973,1840,4145,1843,4148,2301,2303], steps: ["To begin making the Broccoli Quiche recipe, you will first have to prepare the crust for the quiche. Use this recipe of","to make the crust base. Prepare a 9-inch (2-inch-deep) round pie/tart pan with removable bottom","Preheat the oven to 180 C","After 30 minutes of refrigeration, bake the pie dough in the preheated oven until pie is set and edge is pale golden in ","While the pie crust is baking in the oven, we will make the broccoli filling","Now we will make the white sauce for the quiche; whisk together bechamel sauce, sun dried tomatoes, nutmeg, red chilli f","Once the pie shell has been bakes until golden, remove from the oven and pour white sauce filling into the pre baked pie","Place the Broccoli Quiche back into the oven and bake until the quiche custard is ser and the cheese has a golden crust "] },
"breakfast_potato_quiche_with_tender_corn": { title: "Breakfast Potato Quiche with Tender Corn", serves: "4", time: "55 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["Potatoes (Aloo)","Whole Black Peppercorns","Milk","Whole Wheat Flour","Baking powder","Sweet corn","Cayenne Pepper","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves","Cheddar cheese","Salt"], product_ids: [930,2307,4141,4145,1842,473,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Breakfast Potato Quiche with Tender Corn, preheat oven to 200 C","Gently press the grated potatoes between paper towels to dry them as best as possible. In a 9-inch pie plate, toss the p","Press the potatoes into the bottom of the pan and up the sides to form a crust. Bake in the preheated oven for 30 -35 mi","Mean while, in a sauce pan, whisk the whole wheat flour, milk, salt and cayenne pepper. Place the pan on medium heat and","Stir in the baking powder at this stage and whisk until well blended. Turn off heat and add the steamed corn and stir","When the hash brown potato crust is ready pour the corn mixture over it, sprinkle the cheese and return to the oven","Lower the oven temperature to 180 C and bake for about 15 to 10 minutes until the cheese is light golden brown on top","Serve the Breakfast Potato Quiche with a tall glass of freshly made fruit juice like ✅"] },
"vegetable_clear_soup_with_lemon_grass_recipe": { title: "Vegetable Clear Soup With Lemon Grass Recipe", serves: "4", time: "30 min", category: "🍵 Soup", all_ingredients: ["Broccoli","Baby corn","Carrots (Gajjar)","Red Bell pepper (Capsicum)","Lemon Grass","Lemon juice","Basil leaves","Sugar","Salt and Pepper"], product_ids: [2307,2314,48,1840,1842,1843,468,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Vegetable Clear Soup with Lemon Grass Recipe, add 4-5 cups water to a sauce pan, add the lemon grass","Boil the lemon grass for about 5 minutes or so, to release the flavors. The color of the water should be a light green w","Once you notice the flavors of the lemon grass have come into the water, discard the lemon grass, but keep the water","Add the vegetables into the lemon grass water and bring it to a boil until the vegetables are slightly tender. When boil","Turn off the heat and add in the salt, sugar, lemon juice, basil leaves and crushed black pepper","Taste to make sure the flavors are right. You may need to add more lime juice depending on how sour your limes are","Serve the Vegetable Clear Soup with Lemon Grass for a quick and healthy weeknight dinner or for those cold winter nights","Note: You can additionally spice up the soup with a little tobasco sauce or chilli vinegar ✅"] },
