"hirve_kaalvan_recipe_fresh_coriander_and_coconut_c": { title: "Hirve Kaalvan Recipe (Fresh Coriander and Coconut Curry)", serves: "4", time: "45 min", category: "🍛 South Indian", all_ingredients: ["Coriander (Dhania) Leaves","Fresh coconut","Green Chilli","Cumin seeds (Jeera)","Coconut milk","Turmeric powder (Haldi)","Rice flour","Salt","Sunflower Oil"], product_ids: [930,2307,9,4141,973,2301,2302], steps: ["To make Hirve Kaalvan, first wash coriander leaves in water to remove dirt and dust particles. Pat dry coriander leaves ","Next, heat oil in a saucepan over medium heat. Once the oil is heated add coconut and coriander paste made earlier to th","Pour coconut milk into the paste in the pan along with turmeric. Stir to combine and if you feel the curry seems too thi","Allow the curry to simmer on a low flame for about 3 to 5 minutes and turn off the heat","Note: You can make the curry and keep it refrigerated and simmer only when you are ready to serve. This way we don't ove","Serve the Hirve Kaalvan with","for a weeknight dinner or even lunch ✅"] },
