"mumbai_style_masala_khichiya_churi_recipe": { title: "Mumbai Style Masala Khichiya Churi Recipe", serves: "4", time: "30 min", category: "🍛 North Indian", all_ingredients: ["Khichia (rajasthani papad)","Onions","Green Chillies","Cumin seeds (Jeera)","Curry leaves","Sunflower Oil","Red Chilli powder","Chaat Masala Powder","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves"], product_ids: [930,2307,973,920,476,2301], steps: ["To start making the Mumbai Style Masala Khichiya Churi, firstly heat oil in a flat pan. Add the thinly sliced onions til","Take them out and keep them aside to cool down","Heat ghee in a kadhai. Once it is hot add the cumin seeds, green chillies and curry leaves","Add the onions, red chilli powder, chaat masala and salt. Mix everything properly","Meanwhile, crush the khichiya in to very small pieces in a mixing bowl. Add 1 tablespoon ghee and mix everything properl","Now add the onion mixture to the khichiya and mix again. Once it is done, add the chopped green coriander leaves and mix","Your Mumbai Style Masala Khichiya Churi is now ready to be served with ✅"] },
"matar_aur_chilke_ka_sabzi_peas_peel_stir_fry_recip": { title: "Matar Aur Chilke Ka Sabzi (Peas & Peel Stir Fry Recipe)", serves: "4", time: "30 min", category: "🥡 Indo-Chinese", all_ingredients: ["Green peas (Matar)","Spring Onion (Bulb & Greens)","Turmeric powder (Haldi)","Red Chilli powder","Green Chillies","Salt","Sunflower Oil"], product_ids: [2307,973,503,2301,476,925,2302], steps: ["To prepare Matar Aur Chilke Ka Sabzi (Peas & Peel Stir Fry Recipe), Wash the green pea pods. Take out the peas from the ","Take half of the peels of peas. (discard the rest). Break the tip and the bottom of each pod peel and discard the long f","Chop the white part of spring onion lengthwise and the green part into 1-2 inch pieces","Heat the oil in a kadai and add panch phoron. When the seeds begin to splutter add chopped white part of the spring onio","Then add chopped peels of green pea pods, spring onion greens and half of the green peas extracted from the pods. Stir a","Add in turmeric powder, chopped green chilies and salt","Cook covered on low-medium heat till vegetables are just tender","Remove from heat and serve Matar Aur Chilke Ka Sabzi (Peas & Peel Stir Fry Recipe) hot as a side-dish with ✅"] },
"kondakadalai_vazhathandu_puli_thengai_kuzhambu_rec": { title: "Kondakadalai Vazhathandu Puli Thengai Kuzhambu Recipe (Banana Stem Cur", serves: "4", time: "530 min", category: "🫘 Dal", all_ingredients: ["Kala Chana (Brown Chickpeas)","Banana Stem","Salt","Turmeric powder (Haldi)","Methi Seeds (Fenugreek Seeds)","White Urad Dal (Split)","Dry Red Chilli","Coriander (Dhania) Seeds","Fresh coconut","Sesame (Gingelly) Oil","Mustard seeds","Curry leaves"], product_ids: [929,930,2307,2308,9,973,503,920], steps: ["We begin making the Kondakadalai Vazhathandu Puli Thengai Kuzhambu Recipe (Banana Stem Curry with Black Chickpeas Recipe","Then empty the black chickpea into a bowl, then in the same pressure cooker, add the banana stem with little water, salt","Heat a heavy bottomed pan, add oil and crackle mustard seeds and curry leaves. Then add the ground paste and sauté for f","Finally add the cooked banana stem and chickpeas, season it well and add some water to make it little gravish","Serve the Kondakadalai Vazhathandu Puli Thengai Kuzhambu Recipe (Banana Stem Curry with Black Chickpeas Recipe) along wi","to enjoy your dinner meal ✅"] },
"oats_yogurt_parfait_with_chocolate_almond_topping": { title: "Oats & Yogurt Parfait with Chocolate Almond Topping Recipe", serves: "4", time: "20 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["Instant Oats (Oatmeal)","Water","Honey","Muesli","Strawberries","Anardana Powder (Pomegranate Seed Powder)","Apple","Badam (Almond)"], product_ids: [0,24,2314], steps: ["To start the preparation of Oats & Yogurt Parfait with Chocolate Almond Topping, boil the oats with water in a pan","Once it is cooked, add the honey, stir it well & allow it to cool. Once that is done, put it in a long glass","First, add the cooked oats followed by the yogurt","Then spread Muesli over it and add the cut fruits","Top this with almonds, and garnish with chocolate syrup","Serve Oats & Yogurt Parfait with Chocolate Almond Topping as a Healthy breakfast or after dinner dessert ✅"] },
"low_fat_fruit_parfait_recipe_no_bake_french_desser": { title: "Low Fat Fruit Parfait Recipe (No Bake French Dessert Recipe)", serves: "4", time: "25 min", category: "🍮 Dessert", all_ingredients: ["Apple","Musk Melon","Orange","Fresh Cherries","Ripe Bananas","Hung Curd (Greek Yogurt)","Jam","Corn flakes","Honey","Fresh Cherries","Mint Leaves (Pudina)"], product_ids: [0,2314,4142,15,16,946,1842,27], steps: ["To start the preparation of Low Fat Fruit Parfait , chill the serving glass before assembling the dish","Make a layer of the hung curd (you can alternatively use thick flavored yogurt too)","Top it with the melted jam.Arrange the chopped fruits on this jam layer","Drizzle honey on the fruits and top it with crushed cornflakes and top with glazed cherries and mint","This Low Fat Fruit Parfait can be served as a Healthy breakfast dish or an after dinner dessert ✅"] },
"date_obattu_recipe_date_puran_poli": { title: "Date Obattu Recipe (Date Puran Poli)", serves: "4", time: "90 min", category: "🍛 Curry", all_ingredients: ["Dates","Badam (Almond)","Cardamom (Elaichi) Pods/Seeds","Dessicated Coconut","Jaggery","Sooji (Semolina/ Rava)","All Purpose Flour (Maida)","Salt","Sunflower Oil"], product_ids: [2307,9,2314,460,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Date Obattu recipe, first we need to prepare the ingredients required for this recipe","Soak dates in 1/2 a cup of hot water for 1-2 hours","Grind the almonds to a powder","Grind the dry coconut into a thick paste with very little water","Now grind the soaked dates mixture without any additional water to a smooth paste","Combine date paste, almond powder, coconut paste and jaggery (if using) in a pan and cook for 2-3 minutes","Let this mixture cool slightly and shape them into 4 equal sized balls and set aside","In mixing bowl add semolina, maida, salt and enough water to make a soft and knead well for 6 to 8 mins and let it rest "] },
