"rava_puttu_recipe": { title: "Rava Puttu Recipe", serves: "4", time: "30 min", category: "🌅 Breakfast", all_ingredients: ["Sooji (Semolina/ Rava)","Fresh coconut","Sugar","Water","Salt","Cardamom Powder (Elaichi)","Mixed nuts"], product_ids: [2307,9,2314,460,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Rava Puttu recipe, dry roast rava in medium flame until it slightly changes colour","Once done, put rava in a mixing bowl. Add salt and sprinkle water little by little. Mix well to get crumble like consist","Take grated coconut and sugar in a bowl and mix. Add it to the bottom of puttu maker to form a coconut layer","Add the rava mixture to form a layer on top of coconut layer. Place the puttu maker in top of steamer and steam for 10 m","Once done, add the steamed puttu to a bowl, add some more coconut, sugar, cardamom powder, nuts and mix well. Serve it w","Serve Rava Puttu along with","for a weekday meal ✅"] },
