"tabbouleh_recipe_a_mediterranean_salad": { title: "Tabbouleh Recipe (A Mediterranean Salad)", serves: "4", time: "35 min", category: "🥗 Salad", all_ingredients: ["Couscous","Parsley leaves","Extra Virgin Olive Oil","Tomato","Lemon juice","Onion","Cucumber","Salt and Pepper"], product_ids: [545,482,2307,924,48,476,2301,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Tabbouleh Recipe, combine couscous along with 1 1/2 cups of boiling water in a large bowl","Cover the pan and allow the bulgur to rest and soak in the water for about an hour, until most of the water is absorbed.","To the above soaked couscous, add in the oil, lemon juice, onions, parsley, tomatoes, and cucumber, along with the salt ","Cover and refrigerator for at least half an hour. This helps to bring out the flavors of the parsley and lemon well into","Serve Tabbouleh along with a warm with","It makes a perfect packed lunch that is nutritious and filling too ✅"] },
