"punjabi_toor_dal_tadka_recipe_using_preethi_electr": { title: "Punjabi Toor Dal Tadka Recipe Using Preethi Electric Pressure Cooker", serves: "4", time: "40 min", category: "🫘 Dal", all_ingredients: ["Arhar dal (Split Toor Dal)","Onion","Ginger","Garlic","Green Chillies","Tomato","Turmeric powder (Haldi)","Red Chilli powder","Coriander Powder (Dhania)","Salt","Lemon juice","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves"], product_ids: [545,930,2307,2308,2314,973,48,503], steps: ["To begin making the Punjabi Toor Dal Tadka Recipe,press the menu option of the electric pressure cooker and keep pressin","Allow the pan to preheat for about 4 minutes. Once the pan is heated, add the ghee, onions, ginger, garlic, green chilli","Once done add the tomatoes, turmeric powder, red chilli powder, coriander powder, garam masala powder and salt to taste.","After the tomatoes are soft add the toor dal along with two cups of water. Stir well to combine and cover the pressure c","Now change the menu option to Dal Mode. To do this press the keep warm option and then the Menu. Press plus button till ","Once done the electric cooker will go into the \"ÖH\"mode indicating that the cooking time is completed. Allow the press","Stir in coriander leaves and squeeze juice from one lemon. Keep aside","Transfer the Punjabi Dal Tadka into a serving bowl and serve hot ✅"] },
