"dahi_ke_kebab_recipe_dahi_kebab_greek_yogurt_kebab": { title: "Dahi Ke Kebab Recipe | Dahi Kebab | Greek Yogurt Kebabs", serves: "4", time: "2820 min", category: "🥟 Snack", all_ingredients: ["Hung Curd (Greek Yogurt)","Green Chilli","Black Salt (Kala Namak)","Cumin powder (Jeera)","Salt","Saffron strands","Gram flour (besan)","Coriander (Dhania) Leaves","Whole Wheat Bread crumbs"], product_ids: [930,2307,2308,2314,973,4142,4143,2302], steps: ["To begin making the Dahi Ke Kebab Recipe we will first make the hung curd","You can also use Greek yogurt that is thick and free from whey","To make hung curd, place a muslin cloth/ cotton handkerchief over a strainer. Place the strainer over a bowl to collect ","Add the curd/ greek yogurt to the muslin cloth.Place this for at least 24 hours or 2 days (more the better) in the refri","The whey gets separated and collected in the bowl below. The hung curd will be thick and collected in the muslin cloth. ","The important thing to note here is the yogurt should be thick, with no whey","Preheat the oil for deep frying. Use a small deep frying pan, as the oil cannot to reused again, as there will be a lot ","The kebabs are cooked on high heat and fry very fast. Hence it is important to keep the oil preheated. We will fry the D"] },
